         <h4 data-copy-set="C06-004"><em>Pil ömrü</em>100 saate kadar </h4>
        </div> </li> 
       <li class="battery__info-item saving-mode" role="listitem"> 
        <div class="battery__info-value"> 
         <h3 class="battery__info-title" data-copy-set="C06-005">Egzersiz güç tasarrufu modu</h3> 
