battery lasts all\u002Dday and can definitely do atleast 24hrs without charging. Its so easy to set up as well, easy to connect to my phone and use it (mine is a Samsung). And the watch can definitely stand its test, where the previous ones gained scratches over time, this watch will all the abuse it\x27s recieved still looks brand new.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22I Love IT\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22CyrilLJ\x22,\x22Videos\x22:[{\x22VideoCaptionUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/video.api.bazaarvoice.com\/4d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\/video\/movie.vtt\x22,\x22VideoId\x22:\x224d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\x22,\x22VideoHost\x22:\x22BAZAARVOICE\x22,\x22VideoThumbnailUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/video.api.bazaarvoice.com\/4d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\/thumbnail\/image\u002D00001.png\x22,\x22VideoIframeUrl\x22:null,\x22Caption\x22:null,\x22VideoUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/video.api.bazaarvoice.com\/4d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\/video\/movie.mp4\x22,\x22VideoTypeCode\x22:\x22M\x22,\x22VideoType\x22:\x22mp4\x22}],\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u00