                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Upgraded from my Watch 5 Pro the new Ultra is definitely a big improvement. The Ultra is so much quicker and less laggy. I consider it up to today&#39;s standards for a smart watch. The Galaxy AI feature on the Ultra is cool with the sleep score. It also gives you an idea of your energy score by using your previous day activities and sleep score to let you know what how your body is. 

Battery run time between the Watch 5 Pro and Ultra is about the same (well they both have the battery capacity). 

So far we have 2 Watch Ultras for me and the wife. We both love it compared to our W5P.</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="cta cta--underline-v2 cta--black cta--icon pdd44-review__contents-detail-view-more" data-text-more="Daha fazla oku" data-text-less="Daha az göster" an-tr="review list_review detail container-product detail-view more-review" an-ca="review" an-ac="customer review" an-la="review detail:view more">
                            <span>Daha fazla oku</span>
                            <svg class="icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
                                <use xlink:href="#open-down-bold" href="#open-down-bold"></use>
