                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] First this ultra has the best battery life...almost 48hrs! I only use wifi and Bluetooth. I don&#39;t use cellular cause my phone is always with me or within range to find. The AI that is used for heart rate is not noticeable, but I do notice an improvement with accuracy and the speed of measurement. This watch recognizes exercises and is more attentive to movements. 

Now, the only negative I have to say is the mirror finish is still on the metal edges of this watch and will be distracting for some drivers. I have a cover on mine to reduce scratches and to cover the shiny parts.

Overall, I enjoy this watch with the new stretch bands and colors.</div>
                        </div>
