                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Great watch!
Great size.  It is large, but it blends in.  It is smooth when using multiple features.  The screen size helps with reading or when calling someone. 
The watch bands can be switched out easily and quickly.  I like the push button lock.  I have three different styles and colors.  You can customize for your day or event. 
The volume is loud and I specifically like the emergency alert ping.  I am a hunter, and I can see the need to alert for help at times.  This in line with the track back feature in the hiking app really helps a person get back on track or get out of unfamiliar territory.  Hell, it could just be a parking spot.  Lol</div>
                        </div>
