                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I upgraded to the 7 Ultra from my 4 classic. Thought I would miss the bezel but so far it hasn&#39;t bothered me. Everything about the ultra has just impressed me and functions so much smoother than I was expecting. Seen alot of reviews talking about the weight and size but also don&#39;t even notice it. I also love the locks for the wrist band. Makes it so easy to switch bands when I need to put the case on it to keep it protected at work then switch to the normal band on my days off. The battery life has been a huge upgrade. With always on I have been getting over 2 days. Cant wait to see what improvements they come up with for the next model Ultra.</div>
                        </div>
