The apps, the smoothness of the touch of the screen, the buttons. My favorite part of the Galaxy Watch is the band please continue to make more bands like that. It&#39;s stretchy, comfortable, dries, fast from water, just all around great. When you talk on the phone from your watch, the sound is great. The funny part is when it&#39;s time for my son to go to bed. He plays with my watch and watches YouTube from you. My watch He&#39;s something else but I love the watch. The watch is great and my son loves his well.While it&#39;s on my wrist, but thanks.Samsung continue to make watches like this, please</div>
