                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I found the watch to a good watch with at least a 3 day battery supply. I am still learning more features as I countinue to use it as compared to a Samsung Gear 3 that I had before. Biggest difference in the learning curve is the watch face and how well it adapts for me. My biggest complaint on the purchasing experience is that you need a USB-C charger adapter to be able to charge the phone and it does not come with the watch so you now have to go and purchase one if you do not have one already. I am not talking about the actual magnetic charger, but the adapter part that you plug a USB-C plug into that then plugs into a regular 110v a/c outlet.</div>
                        </div>
