                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Definitely a significant/noticeable upgrade on the 5 PRO that I traded in. Its quite an apparent uptick in the look, performance of this watch over the 5 PRO. Thought I&#39;d find the orange strap and coloring on the watch a bit jarring but the best way to counter that misgiving is that its best to view the watch in person. Given that I&#39;m bit taller than average, the larger size of the watch fits me perfectly as the 5 PRO was a touch small for me me. I don&#39;t even miss the rotating bezel. Its not perfect as the battery life could be a tad better, but its important to mess with the respective settings and features to get the desired batter life.</div>
                        </div>
