                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Watch Ultra is hands down the best smartwatch. As a retail employee that sales smart watches this watch easily stands above the rest. I previously had the Galaxy Watch 5. This watch is a huge upgrade over the Galaxy Watch 5. Among all of the improvements I think the battery is the most impressive. The Galaxy Watch Ultra arrived almost a week ago and I&#39;ve only had to charge it twice. Once when I turned on the device for the first time and the second time today (one week later). I also greatly appreciate the new Galaxy AI features. In particular the energy score feature which tells me exactly how I can improve my energy and sleep.</div>
                        </div>
