                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Pre-ordered the watch after the announcement and I would say I&#39;m not disappointed. The massive 47mm size matches my hand better compared to the usual 44mm Galaxy Watch 6.
The battery lasts almost full 2 days before I need to charge (Based on usual usage: notifications, short calls, usual watch usage, auto track exercise, continuous sensor tracking).
Feels more premium with the titanium material. I used it during sleep and wasn&#39;t bothered by it since I&#39;m used to wearing a smartwatch during my sleep, although I felt it on the first day, but got used to it very fast.
The screen is very bright and vibrant and moving from app to app is very snappy.</div>
