                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have had the Samsung Galaxy Ultra Watch for a month now. And I am incredibly ecstatic! 

I thought I would get decent body measurements. NOPE!

They are surreal! It&#39;s like Galaxy AI is actively transmitting data from my body to the device. Real-time heart rate, breathing exercises, blood pressure, oxygen levels...

Sleep monitoring, stress monitoring, and the list goes on.

BATTERY LIFE is exceptional! Screen is crisp and so bright, and the animations are beautiful and so smooth 😎

The way watch bands pop off and snap in are seamless and effortless. The new action button is useful.

I have nothing but great things to say. So impressed.</div>
                        </div>
