                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I love this watch. I think it&#39;s one of the best ones Samsung has made so far. The only feedback that I have is the battery claims aren&#39;t anywhere near what I have been experiencing with this watch. I have to keep it on power save mode in order for me to have a couple to a few days worth of each side of it. If I don&#39;t have it in power saving mode I need to recharge it with it a day. What other piece of feedback is the watch bands are pretty pricey for the regular retail price. Was glad that I managed to get a second band at a discount. But if I ever want to change bands I think it&#39;s too cost prohibitive. Other than that I love this watch!</div>
                        </div>
