                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Easy to use, comfortable fit. Comes in handy when phone isn&#39;t nearby. Being able to text and make calls is helpful when my device isn&#39;t on my person. The customization of watch faces is great cause I love to have variety. Nice, smooth display for seamless browsing and texting, provides fluid movement for scrolling. I work long hours and the battery life has been more than accommodating, lasting for at least 3 days at a time. The strong titanium casing was a gamechanger considering my work exposes me to the elements. The watch withstands bumps, scratches, and repetitive movement without taking damage and i love it. Well worth every penny.</div>
                        </div>
