                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I received the ultra watch a week and a half ago. My only issue  / problem is with the sleep tracker which powers all the health data. Being a light sleeper, I will wake up in the night and get a glass of water. I did not take it out of sleeping mode or check the time. What I&#39;ve experienced is when I do this, the earlier sleep time is erased and the only data I get is from when I returned to sleep to the morning. So all of the metrics are useless. This has and is been on ongoing issue. I backed off from purchasing a galaxy ring because it might read the same, only half of my sleep. I have since returned back to my Garmin epix watch for sleep data.</div>
                        </div>
