                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The sleep tracking with Galaxy AI is game changer.  It lets me know in depth detail of my sleep and plays into my Energy Score which I use to improve my overall sleep health. With the recommendations from the health help I have improved my sleep and hence how I feel throughout the day.
The device also works great with the new Galaxy buds that I got, they connect without any issues and I can leave my phone behind and still have access to all my music while out I&#39;m and about.  
The only reason it doesn&#39;t get 5 is battery life. It does last me the day and a night but I&#39;m having to charge at odd times to make sure I get my sleep monitored every night.</div>
                        </div>
