                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Getting rid of the bezel was NOT a good idea from Samsung. And while I like the shape, the extremely limited customization functions of the three buttons is ridiculous and hurts the usefulness of the watch. Especially when you DOUBLED the price, without doubling the features and functions!!! The bands should be magnetic instead of this antiquated lock. While I do like the new attachment function for the bands, there aren&#39;t nearly enough choices of different bands to make it a really useful feature. WHY IS THERE EKG, BUT NO BLOOD PRESSURE function in the USA?????? It&#39;s moronic to not be able to do blood pressure, but you can do EKG. Come on Samsung!</div>
                        </div>
