                            <svg class="icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
                                <use xlink:href="#message-regular" href="#message-regular"></use>
                            </svg>
                            <span class="pdd44-review__contents-response-header-text">Samsung&#39;dan yanıt:</span>
                        </div>
                        <span class="pdd44-review__contents-response-header-date">2024-10-01</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body">
                        <p class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body-title">R&amp;R Team</p>
                        <p class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body-text">Hey Stevae. It&#39;s great to hear from you and get your feedback on the Galaxy Watch Ultra. Train your way to triathlon triumph. Effortlessly transition between workouts with a press of the Quick Button while monitoring every step of the journey. Switch between sports easily and create your own challenges. The Galaxy Watch7 bands include a one-click button design that lets you change out the watch bands whenever you like. You can push the button to connect a band, and then push the button again to release the band. Blood pressure monitoring has yet to receive FDA approval for any Galaxy Watch, therefore this feature is not available in the U.S. Some other countries do have this option, however. We appreciate you taking the time to share your honest feedback with us. If you have any further concerns or questions, please be sure to reach out to us at Samsung Support. -Kelvin
smsng.us/Samsung-Support 
smsng.us/Facebook-Messenger 
smsng.us/X-Messages
smsng.us/Samsung-Community 
smsng.us/Warranty-Info
smsng.us/Samsung-Care-Plus</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        
