                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I love this Galaxy Watch. I use it in every way possible aside from telling time and date. 
I have better control of health thanks to all the apps and gadgets embedded in it. My heart rate, sleeping patterns, and stress levels assist me in staying in my best through out the day.

The gestures are great to cancel a call or stop an alarm without distractions or hesitation, I simply pinch twice.

Screen customizations are possible, different colors, and set ups which makes the watch screen looking unique. 

And the 3 side buttons, a simple and easy way to get some of those apps going by simply clicking on it, and those buttons are customizable as well.</div>
                        </div>
