                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] As being Previous Watch 6 Classic user,  Watch ultra design design in photos was not that attractive but when watch arrived and used, love it, it is more bright, more fast and more spacious screen. Multiple sports activities are great. Design looks great on the wrist.
Surprisingly, being little thick design watch is very light weight.
Only thing which really let down was the straps received with the watch, orange colour is not a every day use colour. It looks great but may be only leisure time but to use it daily where smart casual looks required, wouldn&#39;t recommend orange colour. I really wished if there was a grey/black colour strap come with watch.</div>
                        </div>
