                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really, really like this watch. I used to be a g shock man, but this watch is really cool. It does everything my phone does, please? Music tells me where I&#39;m at gives me directions home. I talked to it like I talked to my phone. Super cool I use it every day. I have high blood pressure. It checks my heart ekg. It checks the time I sleep. The time I wake up Tracks, everything, all in all of this thing is, my daily use. Go to and the battery life is amazing.It&#39;s like two and a half 3 days battery life!! If you want a durable, long-lasting Galaxy phone.This is the way to go!! I highly recommend to anyone looking for a new watch piece!</div>
                        </div>
