                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">First off, this watch model has grown on me. Initially, I was wasn&#39;t digging how close it looked to its competitions but the minor differences started to make it stand out much more. The grey color is classic and sleek. 

Secondly, the hardware itself is super responsive. No lag whatsoever after 3 weeks of use. The sleep tracking and also giving me a energy score to start my day puts me on the right track. 

What I don&#39;t like? 
Firstly, the price is high. 
secondly, the wear os does not let me use apps like Facer to put custom watch faces that I&#39;ve been using for over 5 years. Disappointing when I got this and couldn&#39;t install.</div>
                        </div>
