                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Being able to not have my phone in my hands at all times is a great help for me specially at work due to sometimes having thing in my hands and not being able to put things down to check what the text message that I just received says. The seamless connection between devices and the responsiveness of the watch is unparalleled to the last generation and that of the competition, not to mention the compliments I get about how sleek and yet robust the design is. 10 out of 10 in my book. Having my center button as my key to activate the flashlight in the watch is also a life savior for whenever I&#39;m looking for my TV remote in the dark 😅.</div>
                        </div>
