                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Just bought this, took a bit to recieve, but not letting that get to me!! Absolutely love it :) I should have never upgraded from my watch 5 pro to the 6 classic, BIGGEST waste of money, EVER! BUT when the 7 ultra came out, I was MORE than ready. 

Little lady of 5&#39;3 here, and some small wrists, I see all these &#34;manly&#34; comments. BUT for my ladies it fits good! It looks so good and nice. Works great with workouts and tracking steps, and looks cute with the band I have :) 

Band is ADJUSTABLE! Gotta read the instructions and what not. 

Battery is decent, trying to let it settle into my activities before I really dis the battery life.</div>
                        </div>
