                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I use my watch as an extension of my phone. It&#39;s a great companion to the galaxy phone. I have a panic disorder so it helps keep track of my heart rate, and if you leave your phone at home you can still use the watch to message. I actually left my phone on the way to the gym and was able to message my partner so I could get it. I do like the Galaxy AI features also. It&#39;s nice yo have live translate when you travel or have Galaxy AI help you find what you need. I also have the Galaxy buds 3 pro to help with call translations and such. All in all, they are great to have and use in every day life. Looking forward to the S25 Ultra soon!</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="cta cta--underline-v2 cta--black cta--icon pdd44-review__contents-detail-view-more" data-text-more="Daha fazla oku" data-text-less="Daha az göster" an-tr="review list_review detail container-product detail-view more-review" an-ca="review" an-ac="customer review" an-la="review detail:view more">
