                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I recently got my hands on galaxy watch ultra and guess what I’m amazed by it’s interesting new AI features and battery life. It is a very durable watch, bright and look great on my wrist. It does my health and fitness tracking. It monitors my heart rate, ECG, blood pressure measurements and sleep tracking. It does my step counts. I can personalise my watch dial. I can change the wrist bands to match it to any occasion. I love the feature when it makes me stand up and walk because I work in the office and I’m mostly sitting in front of the computer. I can use hand gestures to operate my watch as well.  I would definitely recommend.</div>
                        </div>
