                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I bought this as part of the Black Friday promotion to replace my Watch 5 Pro. I was looking for some of the additional sensor capabilities and accuracy. I do like the ease of changing bands and found inexpensive adapters that allowed using the 20mm bands from my former watches. 

The screen looks great and it is responsive. However, after wearing it for a day I had to return it. It was so heavy that it actually hurt my wrist and started to make my hand numb. It also won&#39;t work with the watch faces I bought for my earlier watch, but I could have lived with that.  I really wanted to like this, but I&#39;m sticking with my 5 Pro for now.</div>
                        </div>
