                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I purchased this watch to replace the Galaxy Watch Pro 5.   Good move by me.  I loved my previous Watch and basically wanted to update for a better health readings and well it also had to have a same or better battery.   I don&#39;t even know how to explain it.  But this watch seems.to work much better overall than Old Watch Pro 5.   I mentioned to friends too.  Whatever AI is in this watch in conjunction with the Samsung Ultra 24 phone i have not touched on it much yet.   I wish the BP part would work in the USA.   But I understand you can thank the FDA for not allowing that yet.  Amazing considering a galaxy watch active could do it.</div>
                        </div>
