                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have owned almost all of the Galaxy watches released.  There was a period of time recently where the battery life and use of the device wasn&#39;t as good as it used to be.  I gave the Ultra a shot and so far have been blown away.  It&#39;s is very fast, responsive, loud, and best of all, the battery life has been amazingly.  I can easily get 2 full days of decent use including sleep tracking and some workouts.  I haven&#39;t had a chance to use all the Galaxy AI features yet but so far it&#39;s been good, definitely heading in the right direction.  The size is great, and fits perfectly in my wrist, and the orange band looks really good.  Highly recommend this watch!</div>
                        </div>
