                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I recently upgraded from a Galaxy watch 4 to the new Galaxy Watch Ultra and couldn&#39;t be more pleased. From the new easier to swap watch band to the large ergonomic face the Ultra is hands down the best on the market! The information I would have had to scroll through on my Watch 4 to find is now all on the first screen. Health and fitness goals, stress levels, time/date, battery level, weather information and a compass all on the face with many other options to configure to your needs and liking. Watch faces are easier to obtain with more choices also. A stylish look with larger buttons and a quicker response for device wake up are all much appreciated.</div>
                        </div>
