                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">My 1st smart watch ever. Its a little big but i really like it. The band not so much its not that flexible and wont sit nice on the wireless charger i have to put something ontop of it to make sure it charges over night. Dont know if its the charger or watch but if its the watch the housing needs to be redesigned to allow use of wireless chargers. Many features. i dont trully know how to use it 100% yet but am learning samsung sends updates every know and then. So far i love the ease of use. Am a blue collar worker so not having to take my phone out of my pocket with very dirty or greasy hands its great i just look at my wrist when i get a notification.</div>
                        </div>
