                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I love the features but it is WAY bigger than my galaxy classic 4 which was 46mm and this is only 47mm! Also I ABSOLUTELY HATE the band that came with it!! It&#39;s either too tight or too loose. There&#39;s no happy place and it&#39;s extremely frustrating and uncomfortable. I have pretty average size wrists and measured and went with the appropriate band size as i was right in the middle of the md/lrg size. I can&#39;t wait for more bands to be released to see if that will help, that is if I decide to keep it because it&#39;s enormous and expensive. Plus why is it that I cannot access FB messenger on this watch but yet it tells me my temperature?!?</div>
                        </div>
