                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I was skeptical about buying something new but after receiving and setting up the watch it really changed my thoughts. The setup was simple all my previous settings linked up directly from my old watch. The battery life is exceptionally well, it last all day without needing to be charged. The health monitors in this watch are amazing tracking sleep, a snore detection, heart rate and overall health. I can track a multitude of exercises throughout the day. The display and backlight is exceptional clear and the faces give you many options to display on the watch. Can&#39;t wait to upgrade to the S24 Ultra soon to get the full experience.</div>
                        </div>
