                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I traded in the first generation Galaxy watch for this one. It is as advanced as you might expect. Easy to learn and personalize. Lots of nice features. I would give it 5 stars, except the battery is disappointing. My old watch, even after 8 years, would still go from 6am until 10 pm the next night. I thought the new watch would have a better battery, but it only lasted about 28 hours before it went into power saving, and shut off completely about 7pm the second night. Perhaps my expectations were unrealistic, but I thought it would last longer than an 8 year old watch. Other than that, I do love everything else about this watch.</div>
                        </div>
