                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Since smart watches have existed, I have been a demanding fan of these fascinating technologies. Always looking for comfort, versatility and above all the functionality of the device. My Galaxy Watch Ultra more than meets expectations... This Galaxy AI blew my mind. Its design makes it perfect for all my activities, the weight it carries is simply hard to believe and the speed and functionality make it unattainable. I use Bixby as my personal assistant and it is surprising how easy it is for me to make reminders, make calls, schedule the calendar and make notes instantly. In my swimming routine it becomes my assistant and I simply cannot train without it.</div>
                        </div>
