                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Traded my Galaxy 4 classic in on the new Galaxy ultra 7! Battery life is 3-4 days! Smooth bezel operation! Simple to transfer from classic 4 to the new Ultra 7! The finish is really nice, the Silicone band is Fantastic! Health tracking is more accurate! Speakers are better for phone usage! This is a Fantastic Smartwatch! Samsung really out did themselves on this watch! Plus the new Watch faces just for the Ultra are super, having all info you want right there on the watch face &amp; customize it is great! Got a Battery update which may &amp; suppose to even make battery life better, it&#39;s still updating based on my usage! Had now for over a month &amp; simply love it!</div>
                        </div>
