                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I&#39;ve used my new Galaxy Watch Ultra for about a week now. And so far it is working great.

The new health sensors seem to pick up more data and more detailed results than my previous smart watch.

I haven&#39;t quite gotten used to the advanced Galaxy AI features yet.  I think it still is learning my daily habits. So I may update my review after more time with it.

But if you are looking to upgrade the ultra is awesome. Battery last longer. So far Without power saving mode on, I currently have 1 day 4hours remaining and it shows it&#39;s been 1 day and 17 hours since my last charge. So seems to be getting well over 2.5 days on a charge.</div>
                        </div>
