                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I use the watch for sleep monitoring and counting steps.  Sometimes I will take calls with its speaker phone. 
I would like a digital display that shows heart rate clearly at all times.  This goes to HRV monitoring.  The rubber watch band is well designed.  It is always comfortable.  Heart monitoring hasn&#39;t changed.  And every night in the 4 AM or so time frame the watch has a gap in data gathering.  I&#39;ve had to reconnect it a few times.  A user should probably charge it often enough to avoid power saving mode.  I should still investigate all the features..  I&#39;m probably missing something.  If it had stronger heart analytics, it would help me with HRV etc.</div>
                        </div>
