                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I own about 3 other watch from Samsung, and it is everything I expected, it has every function available to carry you though your day yo day  life. 
You can wear it in your sleep, to the gym, wear it while going to the grocery store, on a hike and even swimming.
I love the size it has a pretty sizable face 47mm,;which is way bigger from it&#39;s previous predecessors, this updated watch might not have the rotating bezel like previous watches but it make up for it with the new the 3 button design instead of the usual two.
The Samsung watch ultra does come with the Galaxy AI feature that is now accessible on all Samsung Galaxy Phones.</div>
