                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have never owned a smart watch or fitness tracker before and have been blown away by not just the look of this device, but the function and battery life too.

I find the health aspects particularly good, especially sleep tracking.  It works seamlessly with my Android device and I regularly get two days out of it.  It charges quickly too so I&#39;ll often put it on in the morning so I have it for a full two days.

It is a large watch face but is not heavy.  The default band it came with is very comfortable too.  The Super AMOLED is so clean and bright.

It has exceeded every expectation, and my wife is already considering making the leap from her fitness band!</div>
                        </div>
