                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This watch is my fave!  It does everything I need and more – way better than I expected. I never take it off except to charge it (wish it had Gemini instead of Google Assistant though!).  I hope you&#39;ll make a square or rectangular version someday, like the old Galaxy Gear – more screen space! That&#39;s what got me into Samsung watches in the first place.  It&#39;s gorgeous. Seriously, I got at least two or three coworkers to buy one, and my son did too!  Bigger sizes would be awesome in the future; my eyesight isn&#39;t what it used to be, and I bet a lot of us older folks, especially guys, would love a bigger watch. Also more AI features</div>
                        </div>
