                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I had upgraded from watch 6 to watch ultra. I absolutely love it. The AI features on the watch are awesome and works smoothly. 
The battery life is awesome. I haven&#39;t enabled NFC all the time as it drains the battery and workout it I can use the watch without charging for couple of days easily. 
It&#39;s a perfect size for my wrist. It does not feel heavy. The strap is long lasting and durable. 
Mic works really well and speakers are loud enough to hear everything clearly.
Setup and sync with my phone was a breeze. It&#39;s like a family and knows exactly how to interact with samsung products. I am extremely satisfied with my purchase.</div>
                        </div>
