                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Been 6 months, worked great until 2 months ago. Now I am forced to reset and relearn the watch every few days. My wife&#39;s galaxy watch 7 (bought same time) has zero issues. So every few days, my phone and watch will disconnect, and I have to set it up again as if it&#39;s a new watch. It&#39;s frustrating, it&#39;s happened while I&#39;m wearing the watch, on the charger, when the phone and watch are separated, last night it was the second the watch hit the charger. Reaching out to customer service today, I&#39;m not the only one, seen a lot of this exact same problem on reddit on a variety of Samsung phones. Galaxy watch ultra paired with zflip 6</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="cta cta--underline-v2 cta--black cta--icon pdd44-review__contents-detail-view-more" data-text-more="Daha fazla oku" data-text-less="Daha az göster" an-tr="review list_review detail container-product detail-view more-review" an-ca="review" an-ac="customer review" an-la="review detail:view more">
