                        <p class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body-text">Hey Craig,
Thank you for taking the opportunity to share your experience with using the Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra. Your feedback is invaluable to us as we strive to provide the best products with superior functionality on the market to our customers.
We understand how frustrating your experience has been so far with your devices not staying connected. If your Galaxy Watch Ultra will not pair to your Z Flip6, or if it randomly disconnects, restart your watch. Please make sure the Galaxy wearable app is up to date, but it may be necessary to reset the app and unpair your watch. I have included some resources to help resolve what you have described to be experiencing with your connectivity. Feel free to review them when you can and reach back out to Samsung Support if you would like any further assistance. We&#39;re always here to help! Thanks for being a loyal Samsung customer.
- Debra

