                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">The Galaxy Watch might look bulky, but it’s surprisingly comfortable to wear, even while sleeping. After adjusting a few settings, I’m getting 2-3 days of battery life, which is solid compared to other smartwatches I’ve used.

I liked how Fitbit devices could be traded in, but I wasn’t happy when the Galaxy Watch’s price dropped later during holiday sales—something to watch out for when purchasing. Performance-wise, it’s comparable to the Fitbit Ultra I had before, and while I haven’t tested its swimming or LTE features yet, I’m overall happy with its functionality and design. Once optimized, this watch is a reliable choice!</div>
                        </div>
