                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I finally upgraded from the original Galaxy Watch to the Watch Ultra.  There was a lot of different apps and options from the original.  Really good display and fitness tracking.  The one major complaint I have with the Watch Ultra is the battery life.  My  Galaxy Watch got 2 days out of it.  Since having the Watch Ultra for the last three days, I have only been getting just over a full day (24 hrs).  VERY disappointing for the cost of the watch.  I keep watching videos and reading threads about the Watch Ultra&#39;s battery life, and it&#39;s all over the place. 

Samsung, please somehow improve the battery life on my watch.

Thanks.</div>
                        </div>
