                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] My new Galaxy Watch Ultra is without a doubt the best smart watch I&#39;ve ever owned! The clarity on this beautiful screen makes my weak eyes enjoy using this practical device. I&#39;ve had fun learning it&#39;s features from my previous Galaxy watch. The band is so comfortable I even forget I&#39;m wearing it. I&#39;m still learning the new Galaxy AI but things like voice texting, the heart rate monitor, the long battery life and ease of use have made me love Samsung even more! I brag to all my fellow Android users they need this wearable too! I learn new things everyday! Thank you for making such an amazing, dependable, feature-heavy product!</div>
                        </div>
