                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">When I first seen the watch on line, I was like, Man I don&#39;t like the square body, however once I recieved the watch and started wearing it, was I wrong, I absolutely love the look.  Sure it is a little heavier than the Classic 6, does not bother me in the least. 

I tried out the sleep apena feature and as my wife thought it let me know that I need to speak to my DR about sleep apena.

Overall the features are great, battery life for me is a little better than the Classic 6, I consider myself a moderate to heavy user.

So, was it worth the money, you bet, with the trade for the Classic 6.  If your on the fence, go for it....</div>
