                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Samsung did it. They brought out a new watch that I couldn&#39;t refuse. The look is way more then expected. The screen is vibrant and large, great for someone like me that has vision issues. The rugged and sleek look makes me less worrysome that I have to be careful with my activity.  The smoothness of the graphics are awesome, no latency found going any activities. The connectivity has been spot on, no issues connecting to devices and remaining connected. Being transparent and honest, this is the best watch I have every had and I have had, meets all my needs and wants, and more. Thank you for listening to your customers Samsung and delivering a superiorproduct.</div>
                        </div>
