                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I really liked my 5 Pro.  But the Ultra,  in my opinion,  is a big step forward.  Mainly,  the battery life.  I&#39;ve seen reviews that dis the battery.  But in my experience so far,  the Ultra&#39;s battery goes twice as long before I have to charge it.  

I also like the square styling of the Ultra, as well as the new band attachment mechanism. 

My only complaint is the band itself  It&#39;s too short for my wrist and I had to buy an off-brand one.  Even the OEM 5 Pro band worked on my wrist,  so I don&#39;t know why the Ultra&#39;s band is shorter. But that&#39;s okay.  I prefer metal bands anyway. I sent the OEM band back for a points credit.</div>
                        </div>
