                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The new Samsung Watch Ultra may not be for everybody.. but why not??  I suppose if your cornered/jailed in that other fruity ecosystem, or you have an itsy bitsy wrist,  this watch may not be a perfect fit. Otherwise, it checks all of the boxes. 
It runs Google&#39;s and Samsung&#39;s latest operating systems, the new watch faces are informative and captivating, the screen face is bright and gorgeous, and the health and wellness information it provides... Just WOW!  And man is it built rugged... Ready for anything outdoors, including the pool or swimming marathons. You can&#39;t go wrong with this watch. It should also hold it&#39;s value well.  I couldn&#39;t be happier with it.</div>
                        </div>
