                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">This is certainly the best watch produced by Samsung. The design is nice, certainly stand out of the market. The performance is also amazing, the animations just feels so refreshing and good. The battery lasts all-day and can definitely do atleast 24hrs without charging. Its so easy to set up as well, easy to connect to my phone and use it (mine is a Samsung). And the watch can definitely stand its test, where the previous ones gained scratches over time, this watch will all the abuse it&#39;s recieved still looks brand new.</div>
