                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">After trying for over a week and going back and fourth between Tmobile and Samsung,  my watch ultra is finally activated as a standalone watch! Both Tmobile and Samsung need to figure out a more efficient way to allow the watch to operate as standalone. Samsung says the watch is standalone, Tmobile continues to tell customers no Samsung watch manufactured after 2018 will work as standalone ( yet they advertise standalone plans). Anywhere, Tmobile finally figured it out and my watch now fully functions as standalone ( as it should, as advertised). I am enjoying the watch, thus far. Samsung, please have a meeting with Tmobile</div>
                        </div>
