                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">The bad, Disappointing battery performance. After just over a month with this watch I&#39;m very disappointed with the battery life, I&#39;m only getting 1 to 1 1/2 days battery life with aod turned off and using stock watch faces. The charging is very slow, over an hour to recharge. The missing spinning bezel was a major design flaw / oversight on Samsung&#39;s part. Replacement Samsung bands are ridiculously expensive.

The good, The watch operates flawlessly otherwise, snappy and bright. comes in handy controlling my s24 ultra and receiving notifications. Health monitoring has been a huge improvement over my past Samsung watches.</div>
                        </div>
