                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Having the very first samsung watch to now the Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 Ultra it is a powerful companion for health-conscious individuals. With its advanced heart rate monitoring capabilities, it can accurately track your cardiovascular health throughout the day and night which is great for people who may suffer from atrial fibrillation. Its robust activity tracking features make it ideal for fitness enthusiasts, allowing you to monitor your steps, calories burned, and sleep quality. Plus, its seamless integration with the Galaxy S24 Ultra ensures a cohesive and convenient user experience, providing real-time notifications and data syncing between the two devices.</div>
                        </div>
