                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This watch has been great for fitness. I mostly run and bike so the improved GPS has been a plus. Recognizes my location way faster. I love the look of the watch. Not too big for my wrist and I chose the more understated grey/black color bands.

Only disappointment was that the case was scratched within a week of my purchase. I&#39;m not even sure when it happened, but I was surprised as the case is supposed to be titanium. Also some of the orange paint was chipped on the face. This has not hindered the use of the watch but if I were doing more rugged sports, I suppose it&#39;d be a badge of honor. But as a casual athlete, I wish it had resisted scratching more readily.</div>
                        </div>
