                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I love my Samsung Galaxy watch ultra. I always upgrade to the flagship model each year. I wasn&#39;t sure that I would like giving up the rotating bezel from the classic series last year but surprisingly I haven&#39;t missed it. I do love that this model is different and distinctive and I&#39;m often asked about it in public. I do love the watch band class or pin system. It&#39;s very convenient for someone like me who changes watch bands almost daily. I love having all of my health information integrated so that I can see everything at a glance. Getting set up for workouts and auto detection features work flawlessly I have no complaints.</div>
                        </div>
