                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Coming from the watch4 44mm,  I knew that the galaxy watch 7ultra would be an up grade, but oh my, this watch blew my sock of and is still impressing me, especially with the AI in the health and fitness. The cushion case is a breath of fresh air. I hope you have a patent on this lug system, it&#39;s the best ever made, no pins to scratch the inner lugs, and so much easier to change out, samsung went above and beyond on making this watch. Can&#39;t forget about the titanium casing, it&#39;s classy and rugged at the same time, you slap a on marine band to do your out door stuff,  or go out on the town with a trail band. Over all with the AI samsung has built a master piece. 👍</div>
                        </div>
