                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Do not waste your money on the Galaxy Watch Ultra. This so-called &#34;premium&#34; smartwatch is nothing but an overpriced piece of garbage. The battery life is absolutely terrible—it barely lasts a day on a full charge. And to make matters worse, it takes a ridiculous 4 hours to charge back up.

The health tracking features? Completely unreliable. The heart rate monitor, sleep tracker, and other health options are far from accurate, making them pretty much useless. If you&#39;re expecting a smartwatch that can actually help with fitness tracking, look elsewhere.

Samsung really dropped the ball with this one. Save yourself the frustration and invest in a better alternative.</div>
                        </div>
