                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I received my Galaxy 7 ultra watch and was very excited. It&#39;s a beuatiful watch and I did have problems with it when I used some of it&#39;s features. I have several tattoos on my arms and the heart rate monitor won&#39;t work it always tells me to scoot the watch down. No matter how many times I do this it won&#39;t work. When I go to use the tutorial for the gestures it keeps telling me to put watch on when I clearly have it on. I really hope yall can fix this and I didn&#39;t waste money on this expensive watch and not be able to use all the features. I put the watch on my wife who has no tattoos on her arm and the watch worked fine.</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="cta cta--underline-v2 cta--black cta--icon pdd44-review__contents-detail-view-more" data-text-more="Daha fazla oku" data-text-less="Daha az göster" an-tr="review list_review detail container-product detail-view more-review" an-ca="review" an-ac="customer review" an-la="review detail:view more">
