                        <p class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body-text">Thank you for sharing your experience with us, Daniel. Your feedback is always needed as we continue to make improvements to our products and services. We see that you are reaching out regarding your new Samsung Galaxy Ultra. Our watches are for everyone! We understand that you are having some concerns over whether your tattoos are interfering with your watch sensor. Samsung offers a 12-month limited warranty for manufacturer defects. If the watch is too loose, or the sensor is dirty, it may have difficulty tracking your steps and heart rate. We recommend that you clean the watch and make sure it&#39;s properly fitted to get the best results. If this persists, please reach out to us at Samsung Support so that we can look into a resolution for this. -Kelvin
