                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Samsung has redefined what a premium smartwatch can be with the Galaxy Watch Ultra—a rugged, intelligent, and beautifully crafted wearable that doesn’t just track time, but enhances your life in subtle, powerful ways. Blending premium design with cutting-edge performance and AI-enhanced features, this watch is a serious contender in the world of ultra-smart wearables. What truly sets the Watch Ultra apart is its integration with Galaxy AI, Samsung’s new on-device artificial intelligence engine. This is not just AI for show—it’s seamlessly woven into the experience, improving utility, personalization, and daily insights.</div>
                        </div>
