                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I had the Watch 6 classic prior to this, and I was nervous reading some of the reviews regarding battery life.  My watch 6 only really ever got a day, maybe a day and a half of use, so I was skeptical this would last.  I&#39;m happy to say the other reviews weren&#39;t correct, and the battery life in the Ultra is amazing.  I get 3 days with regular use before I have to charge it.  Overall, this is a great watch, however, I&#39;m giving it 4 stars, due to not getting full functionality unless you also have a Samsung phone.  I have a Sony Xperia, and the amount I spent on this watch, I should get full functionality.  So be warned if you have anything other than a Samsung phone.</div>
                        </div>
