                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really like this watch. Mostly because it looks cool. The look of this watch makes up for it&#39;s few weaknesses; for example it&#39;s not comfortable. It also won&#39;t charge on a flat charger like my Samsung Trio. However, because it looks so cool, I&#39;m OK with the discomfort and the inconvenience. It also had AI. The AI comes in real handy, when you need it. I love the big screen, typing of a watch was never easy, but on the Ultra, it is very easy. I like the new extra button, it&#39;s nice to quickly start mr workout. The orange is very sophisticated. I like knowing it&#39;s super durable,  I don&#39;t feel like I need to be careful,  I just do am live and I&#39;m confident it&#39;ll be OK.</div>
                        </div>
