                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I originally purchased this watch for tracking my sleep and measure my body composition, but I didn&#39;t know how much easier it would be to communicate and be able to answer calls when I&#39;m away from my phone and see messages and determine whether or not they need to be answered right away or not. I can be away from my phone for long periods of time, so it&#39;s good that I can see my day notifications. Galaxy AI makes it so easy for me to do touch free or communicate touch free when im getting my hands dirty or just dont want to get my phone to do it.  I love my watch and I think I&#39;m going to keep it around for a long time.</div>
                        </div>
