                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I bought this mainly for the longer charge this watch holds, compared to my older Galaxy Watch 6 that would run out the battery in less than a day. The new Galaxy Watch Ultra lasts me almost 2 days (depending on if I use it for working out or not) before having to charge it again! The only downfall is just how bulky it is, so when I do do exercises that has me down on my hands, if my wrist bends at all, it will hit the main button and it has stopped my workout session early. This has happened a couple times now, so I usually slide it down my arm a little when I do those exercises. It&#39;s just annoying, but not a deal breaker for me. Overall, very happy with my purchase!!</div>
                        </div>
