                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] So let&#39;s start with the software and how smooth it is. Very snappy and responsive. I must say that I&#39;m actually impressed with the watch faces from Samsung. I truly hope they continue to produce more watch faces because they are amazing. I love the ability to customize the faces even down to a granular level. The screen size is perfect, the build is substantial, the feel of the watch on my wrist if perfect. If your coming from any of the classics it&#39;s does feel like an upgrade. I miss the rotating bezel but honestly it&#39;s not a deal breaker for me. I&#39;m actually excited to wear my watch again. This is not just another incremental update it&#39;s a major change and I love it.</div>
                        </div>
