                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I am very impressed with my Galaxy Watch Ultra.   Battery life is exceptional,  and I think it&#39;s the best looking Galaxy watch yet. 
The AI aspect of the watch is next level and the health sensors are remarkable. 
I can do an EEG, step counting is accurate,   a close blood OX reading,  heart rate,  and a lot more I haven&#39;t had a chance to check out. 
I currently only use my watch by Bluetooth connecting with my phone but when I can pay for the data plan will be excited about stand alone calls with my watch only. 
Over all I think this watch is worth the money.   
I wear it all day and night.   

Very happy customer!</div>
