                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">I just get mine yesterdayand overall to me the weight is perfect I have big hands and I can text on this one, I trade I. The 5 pro and this one is 10 time better, the battery last right now in my second day and still have 50% I didn&#39;t ajust nothing so the battery las a lot.... play a bit with faces love it, audio is strong, the alarm ia crazy loud, the brightness is to strong some times but you can see the screen perfectly on day light, the watch bands this time are large enough for me.... the temperature sensor works too, the action button can be better but for now I just set the flashlight in double tap, perfect for night if you wake up, is the perfect watch....10/10</div>
