                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Ultra Watch has it all! I am impressed with how seamless and fluid it is to transition from one app to the other or when I&#39;m exercising how easy it is to choose what I&#39;m doing. Along with the ease of setting controls, I love the quick button. I have mine set for running when double pressed so I can start sooner. The face of the Watch is also a plus not to big and not to small. I can text or swipe text with ease. The volume is excellent as well when I&#39;m on call and or just listing to my favorite podcast, I&#39;m not struggling to hear what is being said. Overall  im very satisfied with the Galaxy Watch Ultra.</div>
                        </div>
