                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This watch does have great features that i yet have to explore.  But there are some otems i would change. I was not a fan of the round screen as i feel to much screen is lost due to this. The round bezel on top is no longer spinnable which was kind of a bummer. I feel like the orange main button should be customizable instead of just having it for working out. I also feel like the sleep sensor is a little worse then the previous i was able to get better reading on my old watch. I did like the function of more possibilities of apps. The color itself is nice wpuld have loved a olive green style more this seems as a derivative of the competition.  Overall its an okay watch</div>
                        </div>
