                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I&#39;m new to smart watches. I began my my first journey with the Samsung Ultra watch just a few months ago. I have to say I enjoy all Samsung products. Yet this watch is so helpful in more ways than one, two, or three because it has light weight feel plus durability. Functions are easy to navigate and the docent watch faces are brilliantly innovative with design and smart technology. One of my favorites is the ability to support endangered animals. for the support they give you a watch face which I wear proudly. So many functions. And programming is as easy because I can do it from my phone also.  Thank you Samsung🫡</div>
                        </div>
