                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The watch finally arrived last week. Have been testing back and forth. These are the finding I found about it:-

PROS
+ Nice Big Display
+ Battery life amazingly good
+ Calling and Messaging , very easy to pair up with my phone and also use as a standalone phone on the go

The Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra is a watch available right now if you require full WearOS platform access, excellent GPS accuracy, and a longer battery life. In terms of training heart rate, it&#39;s a little hit or miss (maybe it was me). When I ran and rode indoors, I found it to be fairly accurate. Overall satisfied and would recommend this watch.</div>
