                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have had the Galaxy Ultra for a week now and i am really impressed with its performance .
The first thing i noticed when i opened the box was the build quality which is really impressive.The watch has so many options to personalise the watch faces and functions.
I like using my watch to track my fitness and sleep which the ultra does with great accuracy.
The only negative with the Ultra is it doesn&#39;t have the rotating bezel which is on the Galaxy 6 watch.This is a minor thing though.All in I would  recommend  the ultra to anyone that is interested in keeping an eye on their fitness progress and quality of sleep</div>
                        </div>
