                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The battery life has absolutely amazed me going from my galaxy watch 4 classic I had no idea what I was missing. I only ever charge the watch when I shower and it is always above 50%. if you are worried about it being an inconvenience to charge do not worry. the amount of features always surprises me on my watch, from my detailed sleep patterns so the large variety of workouts that you can select. the watch frame is also very strong. I have nicked it on many surfaces to find that there are still no scratches or dents at all but on the other objects like the desk I bumped it on.I am very impressed with this watch.</div>
                        </div>
