                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] PLEASE STAY AWAY!  If you own Galaxy Watch 4 or later, DO NOT UPGRADE if you like watch face NOT from samsung. Even &#34;Galaxy AI&#34; is not worth upgrading for and a total disappointment. This new watch will not let you use the same watch faces you have been using, even if you have used the same faces on every watch since Watch Active 2. And Galaxy AI is a joke. It&#39;s the same thing you get on older models with the updated OS. I would say upgrade if you own Watch 3 or earlier, but even then, go to the Watch 5 Pro. I&#39;m regretting the trade in. Also, the square dial is GARBAGE. If we wanted a square watch, we would get another brand watch. If you upgrade, you WILL be disappointed</div>
                        </div>
