                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Samsung watch ultra is big, bold and feature packed. 
I have had my watch 5 pro for a couple of years now and was wary the ultra would be too big in comparison but it really is about the same (I have a case on the pro) so I was pleasantly surprised.
I am getting 2 days with the always on mode and 4/5 with raise to wake.
The screen is clear and easy to use and set up quick and simple. 
The auto tracking features so far seem to work great as it has picked up on all the walks I have been on so far. 
I would highly recommend this watch to anyone who wants great battery life and an amazing workout health tracker.</div>
                        </div>
