                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">This watch is incredible. It does everything I wanted it to do very well. Mileage while running and walking is pretty accurate just from what I&#39;ve measured, heart rate while working out on weight machines at the gym is always spot on. Battery life is great at 3 days (including sleep tracking). The device gets warm while charging, but the small magnetic wireless charger is sweet. I only wish it had a usb-c port on it instead of having a cable come out of it.

My only complaints are that is is a thick boy, it&#39;s stand off of my wrist much taller than a regular analog watch. Also, the included strap isn&#39;t terrible comfortable, and also bulky. And replacement straps are pricey.</div>
                        </div>
