                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body">
                        <p class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body-title">R&amp;R Team</p>
                        <p class="pdd44-review__contents-response-body-text">Aloha Liam, 
Thank you for finding the opportunity to share your sentiments with us about your Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra. We value your feedback as we are committed to constant innovation while we strive to improve the design and functionality of our product line. All Galaxy devices have a set temperature range, where they operate at their best. While they may feel warm under certain conditions, like charging, this does not affect the device&#39;s lifespan or performance. However, if your devices get too warm, it could cause some issues. Please take a moment to review, &#34;Keep your Galaxy device at its normal operating temperature&#34; to learn some awesome tips on maintaining your device within its perfect temperature threshold to avoid the possibility of overheating. The Peakform Band for Galaxy Watch Ultra is built to handle everyday activities with ease. It’s designed with a soft touch fabric and durable rubber material, allowing you to stay comfortable in any workout you choose, from cycling to jogging. The Marine Band is crafted to meet the performance standards of the new Galaxy Watch Ultra. Its titanium buckle is light and durable, and the wide ripple design is made for easy water drainage and quick sweat drying. The Trail Band for Galaxy Watch Ultra features a lightweight fabric and Triangle Latch and Hook that fit comfortably around your wrist. Suited for trail running and a wide range of workouts, the wide ripple design allows you to push through your activity with ease. Feel free to check out a different band to help create a Bespoke look. If you have any questions for us or if you would like any further assistance, do not hesitate to reach out to Samsung Support. Thank you for being a staunch Samsung customer. 
- Debra

