                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">The Watch Ultra needs to show correct swim laps when exercising in the pool.
I do 74 laps, and it takes around 50-55 minutes. I compared it with Watch6 (the same result for 74 laps done—the watch showed only 48 and 52 - it doesn&#39;t show all laps) and another brand (the watch showed all the laps I swam—perfect count of the laps), so it is about 30% incorrect, way too much.
It happened after the last update.
Also, the reading of the calories for Watch6 and Watch Ultra are different.
It is unacceptable for such an expensive watch to show the results of exercise with such big differences.
 Please correct the problem.</div>
                        </div>
