                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Long-time user of Android/Samsung products, especially when it comes to watches. So I&#39;ve experienced it from the beginning, and I can say this watch is by far one of my favorites so far. The design is awesome, as well as the battery life! I love how they integrated Galaxy AI into the watch and many other features like sleep score to the action button for workouts! I use this watch every day regardless of the activity. So all in all, there are a lot of improvements and awesome features. I would highly recommend this watch to anyone who enjoys wearing a watch and wants to keep track of their day-to-day activities.</div>
