                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">The most &#34;put together&#34; samsung watch I have owned.  I have owned several generations since the 2nd gen samsung smarth watch and this is the best.  Definitely better accuracy on GPS and calorie burn, and it finally looks like it can compete withe the style and feel of larger traditional mechanical watches.  I was concerned the screen was a bit too large, but it actually has allowed me to use features like email and message summary which were too small to be useful on previous models.  With Galaxy AI, it feels like the watch ecosystem has turned a corner in terms of user engagement.  Very happy with the purchase!</div>
                        </div>
