                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] So, my first impressions of the Samsung Watch Ultra LTE are that I love it! The functions that you are able to tweak, the different faces, and also, I am not a cyclist or runner, but I am an archer, which you can add to the exercises tab. The health benefits of being able to check on blood pressure and ECG as well to help in managing health are great. The apps that are included when downloaded are streamlined and straightforward, adding an LTE data allowance. I can&#39;t wait to put the watch through its paces. Now we have Gemini AI installed also, which can help in searches, menu planning, and other tasks. I can&#39;t believe I have not had a watch like this before. Over the moon!</div>
                        </div>
