                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">This is definitely the best Galaxy watch yet, I&#39;d argue the best combination smartwatch and fitness device on the market. From a user standpoint, it does everything well. GPS and activity tracking are vastly improved from other iterations I&#39;ve had (this is my 8th galaxy watch).  I use the LTE feature and call quality and text messaging work flawlessly.  I was really disappointed there was no option for the rotating bezel, still am, but the screen works really well and I&#39;ve had no real issues with it.  The design grows on you by the day, to the point that it works in any situation.  Classy and sporty.  The GWU is just a comprehensive value buy if you&#39;re big in Smart watches.</div>
                        </div>
