                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have had the galaxy watch 5 pro since that came out and didn&#39;t care about a rotating bezel on the 6. I do alot of out door activities so I need a very strong watch.
The galaxy watch ultra addresses any issue I had with the 5pro. More accurate sensors for health monitoring. Quick access to workouts with the action button. New GPS, amazing. The way that my ultra works with my phone S23ultra to use Galaxy AI is really impressive as well.  

Also, the battery life is just as good as my 5pro was. 
Night mode also a great feature on the ultra face. 

I could keep going, but to sum it up I really can&#39;t think of anything I would change at this point. Really happy with my upgrade.</div>
                        </div>
