                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Watch Ultra is amazing! It&#39;s actually more watch than I need, but it is so worth it. The first thing I noticed was the band attachment. Great upgrade from previous models. It makes changing bands painless. The face of the watch appears to be bigger, but compared to the 5, it&#39;s about the same.The functionality is seamless from one model to the next. The only feature that I haven&#39;t been able to achieve was the double pinch to wake the watch up or take a photo. I&#39;m sure I&#39;ll get it figured out. Overall, I can always depend on Samsung to have a solid mobile phone and watch. They haven&#39;t let me down yet.</div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="cta cta--underline-v2 cta--black cta--icon pdd44-review__contents-detail-view-more" data-text-more="Daha fazla oku" data-text-less="Daha az göster" an-tr="review list_review detail container-product detail-view more-review" an-ca="review" an-ac="customer review" an-la="review detail:view more">
