                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Haha, I&#39;m just a regular user too. And honestly, those features like sleep apnea, sleep time, and heart rate are awesome. But how important are they to you?

I just lift weights and run, so it&#39;s cool. The only problem is if you have tattoos, it won&#39;t read your heart rate. But, like, that makes sense, right?

I don&#39;t have cellular service, but you should totally get it. It&#39;s super convenient, especially for running. You can listen to music without your phone.

Oh, and it&#39;s kinda big, lol, but for me, it&#39;s all about what I like.

I wish the watch could announce the quarter times out loud, that would be helpful.</div>
                        </div>
