                <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail">
                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">Moved up from a Watch 5 Pro.  The 5 Pro was fast, but this Ultra is even faster.  Beautiful display.  Unfortunately, the same issue I saw with the 5 Pro is still present with this model:   it misses most of my floor climbs.  I routinely do 12 - 15 floors every day, but it only records 3 - 4 most days.  Fitbit is much better at recording these accurately.  Other tracking functions appear to be good.  About the same battery life as the 5 Pro, but it seems to charge a little bit more slowly. 
 Disappointed that the magnetic clasp band from the 5 Pro wasn&#39;t available on the new one.  Had to replace it with a third party product.  Overall an impressive watch and I do recommend it.</div>
                        </div>
