                    <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-wrap">
                        <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text-inner">
                            <div class="pdd44-review__contents-detail-text">[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I got the new galaxy ultra watch and in my opinion this is the best watch I&#39;ve gotten by far. It doesn&#39;t feel too heavy especially when I wear it to bed I don&#39;t feel like it&#39;s catching onto my pillow or uncomfortable wearing the device, i love the features of it tracking my blood oxygen while I sleep. How long I was in deep sleep, my body temp. I was worried about this watch since it is a ultra, but i was pleasently surprised and the amount of times I&#39;ve hit this device on the wall or scrapped it I&#39;ve been so worried about if the device was gonna have cracks or scratches and it still looks as if I just pulled it out of the box. This is by far one my favorite samsung purchases</div>
                        </div>
