2:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The sleep tracking with Galaxy AI is game changer.  It lets me know in depth detail of my sleep and plays into my Energy Score which I use to improve my overall sleep health. With the recommendations from the health help I have improved my sleep and hence how I feel throughout the day.\\nThe device also works great with the new Galaxy buds that I got, they connect without any issues and I can leave my phone behind and still have access to all my music while out I\x27m and about.  \\nThe only reason it doesn\x27t get 5 is battery life. It does last me the day and a night but I\x27m having to charge at odd times to make sure I get my sleep monitored every night.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Samsung best watch yet\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Malibuguy16\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235240692\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22c99e7499\u002Dbe45\u002D51ba\u002D9260\u002D368ce68cc49d\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T05:00:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T05:00:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Bluesbreakergalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Galaxy watch ultra is the ultimate watch anyone can dream about with cool \x26 larger display with integrated Samsung AI and brighter than any other watch in the market.\\n\\nWith new robust additions to its design and new and improved battery and the new chip makes this watch so smooth to and flawless in it\x27s operational power.\\n\\nI recommended this watch to my friends and they too loved this watch more than anything else.\\n\\nI believe in Samsung, in it\x27s path breaking innovation in technology in it\x27s team of engineers who are definitely striving hard to be in the lead with the other competitors. \\n\\nI was and always will be with the Samsung nation\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22The best watch till date\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Bluesbreaker\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236328045\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x228b5b029d\u002D4072\u002D54f2\u002Daf44\u002D743314b1544a\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D22T15:45:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D01T15:46:34.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Hey Stevae. It\x27s great to hear from you and get your feedback on the Galaxy Watch Ultra. Train your way to triathlon triumph. Effortlessly transition between workouts with a press of the Quick Button while monitoring every step of the journey. Switch between sports easily and create your own challenges. The Galaxy Watch7 bands include a one\u002Dclick button design that lets you change out the watch bands whenever you like. You can push the button to connect a band, and then push the button again to release the band. Blood pressure monitoring has yet to receive FDA approval for any Galaxy Watch, therefore this feature is not available in the U.S. Some other countries do have this option, however. We appreciate you taking the time to share your honest feedback with us. If you have any further concerns or questions, please be sure to reach out to us at Samsung Support. \u002DKelvin\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity \\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D01\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22weible\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:3,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D22\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22Getting rid of the bezel was NOT a good idea from Samsung. And while I like the shape, the extremely limited customization functions of the three buttons is ridiculous and hurts the usefulness of the watch. Especially when you DOUBLED the price, without doubling the features and functions!!! The bands should be magnetic instead of this antiquated lock. While I do like the new attachment function for the bands, there aren\x27t nearly enough choices of different bands to make it a really useful feature. WHY IS THERE EKG, BUT NO BLOOD PRESSURE function in the USA?????? It\x27s moronic to not be able to do blood pressure, but you can do EKG. Come on Samsung!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22This is NOT worth DOUBLE THE PRICE!!!!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Stevae\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22243784008\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22016d7449\u002Db0c8\u002D5674\u002Da855\u002D9567d1fb2573\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D04T23:15:15.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D16T13:22:46.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (2025) (LTE, 47 mm)(SM\u002DL705FZS2EUA)\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Thanks for the great review and sharing your feedback with us! Should you ever need us, our friendly Support Team are on hand, you can find all our contact methods and opening hours here: Help \x26 Contact Us | Samsung United Kingdom ^DB at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D16\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Norwich\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_4073974\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D04\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] the Galaxy Watch Ultra, is a real head\u002Dturner. With its sturdy titanium frame, super bright display, and a ton of health and fitness features, it’s made for adventure and performance. just want a reliable companion for my daily life, this watch delivers speed, reliability, and style.\\n\\nThe new Quick Button and emergency siren are actually pretty handy, and the upgraded chip makes everything feel super responsive. Battery life is decent, around 2–3 days, though not quite the “Ultra” some might expect.\\n it feels a bit bulky. Also, missing some features since when I am using a iphone.\\n\\nOverall, it’s a feature\u002Dpacked, tough smartwatch with a lot to love.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Eye catching\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22pudensky\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235231821\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22d8ecde00\u002D358e\u002D5783\u002Da65f\u002D71e63c388fbb\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T21:30:17.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T21:30:17.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Charmainegalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I play music all day long at work and I\x27m still at about 50% when I get home. Phones are not allowed on the floor where I work, so having a smartwatch comes in handy.\\n\\nI\x27ve owned just about every Samsung Galaxy watch since Galaxy Watch 3, and this Ultra is the best by far. The AI features are an amazing bonus.\\n\\nThe siren feature is a must\u002Dhave for any woman. You never know when you\x27re going to need it. It\x27s nice to have it just in case.\\n\\nSleep tracker is much, much better because it works with the new feature to measure your energy level throughout the day. The watch will also check to see if you may have sleep apnea.\\n\\nGreat new watch!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Battery life is amazing\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Charmaine\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239723053\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x220a48e6e9\u002Dfc57\u002D5bec\u002D8804\u002D42227f596228\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D13T16:15:20.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D13T16:15:20.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22LoveSamsungUltragalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I love this Galaxy Watch. I use it in every way possible aside from telling time and date. \\nI have better control of health thanks to all the apps and gadgets embedded in it. My heart rate, sleeping patterns, and stress levels assist me in staying in my best through out the day.\\n\\nThe gestures are great to cancel a call or stop an alarm without distractions or hesitation, I simply pinch twice.\\n\\nScreen customizations are possible, different colors, and set ups which makes the watch screen looking unique. \\n\\nAnd the 3 side buttons, a simple and easy way to get some of those apps going by simply clicking on it, and those buttons are customizable as well.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22User\u002Dfriendly gadgets and apps\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22LoveSamsungUltra\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22244131228\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22596f99dd\u002D37f0\u002D5a16\u002Da1a3\u002D72bdf7067c2c\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D20T15:45:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D21T09:27:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (2025) (LTE, 47 mm)(SM\u002DL705FZS2EUA)\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We appreciate the time you’ve taken to let us know your wonderful feedback, and we’re thrilled to know you’re loving your Galaxy Watch Ultra (2025), Usan! ^CL at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D21\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Feltham\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_4297849\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D19\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] As being Previous Watch 6 Classic user, Watch ultra design design in photos was not that attractive but when watch arrived and used, love it, it is more bright, more fast and more spacious screen. Multiple sports activities are great. Design looks great on the wrist. Surprisingly, being little thick design watch is very light weight. Only thing which really let down was the straps received with the watch, orange colour is not a every day use colour. It looks great but may be only leisure time but to use it daily where smart casual looks required, wouldn\x27t recommend orange colour. I really wished if there was a grey\/black colour strap come with watch.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great Looks, Quick, Sharp Display, S Health 👌\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22usan14\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239681601\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2266c937ae\u002D7cc1\u002D5793\u002D810c\u002D7e4a42ee126b\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D12T00:00:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D03\u002D04T04:00:41.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Howdy TDSC, \\nThanks for taking the available time out of your day to share your thoughts with us about your Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra. We appreciate your candor as we make every effort to improve the design and functionality of our product line. Samsung provides a 12\u002Dmonth warranty on our products for manufacturing defects in materials and workmanship. We also offer Samsung Care+ that can be added to eligible devices to provide physical damage protection for your investments. This powerful protection for your Galaxy life covers unlimited drops, spills, and mechanical breakdown. Talk about peace of mind! We would be more than happy to assist you further with what you may be experiencing with the features of your Galaxy Watch Ultra, however, we need more details than we currently have available before we can do so. Please do not hesitate to reach out to Samsung Support at your leisure if you would like any further assistance with troubleshooting your device. Thank you for being a valued Samsung customer. \\n\u002D Debra \\n\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nhttps:\/\/smsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D12\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Massachusetts\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22z3io6vl2qnr09lvi9b4bji0f1i\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:2,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D10\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22The watch is pretty much the Galaxy Watch 7 in a different case with an action button. It\x27s advertised as a tough and rugged version of outdoor sports. Suddenly, one day, the sensors stopped functioning, and then the action button wasn\x27t responding; I am now facing repair costs because it is considered out of warranty for some unseen internal damage. There is no cracked screen, no scratches or nicks. It\x27s never been dropped and slammed against anything, yet somehow, there is damage to the motherboard. I am quickly getting fed up with Samsung, trying to avoid costs at my expense. \\n\\nSo think twice if you invest in this watch for its rugged, tough case.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Not really as advertised\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22TDSC\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x223to5\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x223\u002D5\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Intermediate\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22orta\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to12mos\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D12 ay\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235357087\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22b6617155\u002Dc449\u002D5382\u002Dbb25\u002Db6dd434f3f52\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D06T06:30:03.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D07T08:47:07.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE (47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAEUA)\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22Age\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Thank you for your four\u002Dstar review of the Watch Ultra, Usan! \\n\\nWe’re thrilled to hear that, as a previous Watch6 Classic user, you’re enjoying the brighter display, faster performance, and more spacious screen of the Watch Ultra. It’s great to know that the multiple sports activities and the design have met your expectations, and that the watch feels lightweight despite its more rugged build, and you\x27re enjoying how it looks on the wrist!\\n\\nWe appreciate your feedback regarding the straps. We understand that the orange strap might not suit every occasion or outfit, even though it looks great for leisure activities. We have an excellent range of straps available on our website that suit a variety of occasions, here\x27s the link to view them on our website: https:\/\/spr.ly\/6423YjTSh\\n\\nMany thanks again for the stellar rating! ^AP at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22SamsungUK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D07\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Feltham\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_4297849\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D05\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] As being Previous Watch 6 Classic user,  Watch ultra design design in photos was not that attractive but when watch arrived and used, love it, it is more bright, more fast and more spacious screen. Multiple sports activities are great. Design looks great on the wrist.\\nSurprisingly, being little thick design watch is very light weight.\\nOnly thing which really let down was the straps received with the watch, orange colour is not a every day use colour. It looks great but may be only leisure time but to use it daily where smart casual looks required, wouldn\x27t recommend orange colour. I really wished if there was a grey\/black colour strap come with watch.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Everything is Great Except Straps\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22usan14\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22Age\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x2235to44\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Age\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2235 \u002D 44\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Yaş\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22242611699\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x225cb9b185\u002D935f\u002D5884\u002D85b1\u002D1ac4967eee55\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D13T21:15:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D13T21:15:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22TheRobgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D13\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really, really like this watch. I used to be a g shock man, but this watch is really cool. It does everything my phone does, please? Music tells me where I\x27m at gives me directions home. I talked to it like I talked to my phone. Super cool I use it every day. I have high blood pressure. It checks my heart ekg. It checks the time I sleep. The time I wake up Tracks, everything, all in all of this thing is, my daily use. Go to and the battery life is amazing.It\x27s like two and a half 3 days battery life!! If you want a durable, long\u002Dlasting Galaxy phone.This is the way to go!! I highly recommend to anyone looking for a new watch piece!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Galaxy watch Ultra\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22TheRob\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236779137\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x226ee3f42c\u002D740b\u002D52cc\u002D919e\u002Dfa59acf25057\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D14T22:30:06.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D14T22:30:06.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium Silver\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22New York, NY\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22h68v192f76lprkydmbvo5njms\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D14\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22First off, this watch model has grown on me. Initially, I was wasn\x27t digging how close it looked to its competitions but the minor differences started to make it stand out much more. The grey color is classic and sleek. \\r\\n\\r\\nSecondly, the hardware itself is super responsive. No lag whatsoever after 3 weeks of use. The sleep tracking and also giving me a energy score to start my day puts me on the right track. \\r\\n\\r\\nWhat I don\x27t like? \\r\\nFirstly, the price is high. \\r\\nsecondly, the wear os does not let me use apps like Facer to put custom watch faces that I\x27ve been using for over 5 years. Disappointing when I got this and couldn\x27t install.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Extremely responsive and stylish.\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Roobs\x22,\x2