ntLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D03\u002D27\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Being able to not have my phone in my hands at all times is a great help for me specially at work due to sometimes having thing in my hands and not being able to put things down to check what the text message that I just received says. The seamless connection between devices and the responsiveness of the watch is unparalleled to the last generation and that of the competition, not to mention the compliments I get about how sleek and yet robust the design is. 10 out of 10 in my book. Having my center button as my key to activate the flashlight in the watch is also a life savior for whenever I\x27m looking for my TV remote in the dark 😅.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great Response and Ease of Use!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22ShaADdoWs\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22244618996\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22cece40fb\u002Da176\u002D5796\u002D8ba7\u002Df03a562f3dae\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D09\u002D12T22:30:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D09\u002D15T14:43:18.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (2025) (LTE, 47 mm)(SM\u002DL705FZS2EUA)\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We’re thrilled to read your thoughts and feedback. Thanks for sharing with us and giving us top marks! ^EW at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D09\u002D15\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Ilford\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_4432793\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D09\u002D12\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Watch Ultra is a solid step forward for Samsung. It’s built tough with a titanium frame and a bright, crisp display that’s easy to read outdoors. Fitness tracking is reliable, and the new Quick Button makes switching workout modes super convenient.\\n\\nBattery life holds up well for a full day of use, though heavy users might want more. It’s a bit chunky on the wrist, but that adds to its rugged feel. If you’re into outdoor adventures or serious training, this watch won’t disappoint—especially if you’re already using a Samsung phone.\\n\\nOverall, it’s a powerful and stylish smartwatch that blends durability with smart features.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great for outdoors\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22viktorija135\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x2211 months ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235327205\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22ac56e4a7\u002Db6f2\u002D52d2\u002Dbe54\u002D850db7fd1e42\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D05T17:00:19.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D05T17:00:19.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Pensacola, FL\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zhq5534rdtxyr7z8t1av3kxr1r\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D03\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22Just bought this, took a bit to recieve, but not letting that get to me!! Absolutely love it :) I should have never upgraded from my watch 5 pro to the 6 classic, BIGGEST waste of money, EVER! BUT when the 7 ultra came out, I was MORE than ready. \\n\\nLittle lady of 5\x273 here, and some small wrists, I see all these \\\x22manly\\\x22 comments. BUT for my ladies it fits good! It looks so good and nice. Works great with workouts and tracking steps, and looks cute with the band I have :) \\n\\nBand is ADJUSTABLE! Gotta read the instructions and what not. \\n\\nBattery is decent, trying to let it settle into my activities before I really dis the battery life.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22For ladies too!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x