laxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22z9i9hjw2mfx4hyy4yzsl265q0h\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D01T22:33:16.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zese7iy55p0xuzvbidlq1j5j4v\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D28T19:14:57.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zsnex6slh175t41ykf1y07ucz8\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T22:20:30.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zlem4vidc8wi95uf1iltc45zrz\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D10T22:39:57.000+00:00\x22}],\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:4,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D02\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I use my watch as an extension of my phone. It\x27s a great companion to the galaxy phone. I have a panic disorder so it helps keep track of my heart rate, and if you leave your phone at home you can still use the watch to message. I actually left my phone on the way to the gym and was able to message my partner so I could get it. I do like the Galaxy AI features also. It\x27s nice yo have live translate when you travel or have Galaxy AI help you find what you need. I also have the Galaxy buds 3 pro to help with call translations and such. All in all, they are great to have and use in every day life. Looking forward to the S25 Ultra soon!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great features and excellent phone companion\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22JayAndel\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235822553\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22870d6b1e\u002D3230\u002D5813\u002Dbb47\u002Ddd637d2c269a\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D28T13:30:07.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D28T13:30:07.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE (47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAEUA)\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22Age\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Stoke\u002Don\u002Dtrent\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_1118731\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D28\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I recently got my hands on galaxy watch ultra and guess what I’m amazed by it’s interesting new AI features and battery life. It is a very durable watch, bright and look great on my wrist. It does my health and fitness tracking. It monitors my heart rate, ECG, blood pressure measurements and sleep tracking. It does my step counts. I can personalise my watch dial. I can change the wrist bands to match it to any occasion. I love the feature when it makes me stand up and walk because I work in the office and I’m mostly sitting in front of the computer. I can use hand gestures to operate my watch as well.  I would definitely recommend.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22AI smart\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Alirazazaki\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22Age\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x2235to44\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Age\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2235 \u002D 44\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Yaş\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22237968807\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x226905308b\u002Db830\u002D58a7\u002D9b19\u002D9b0ca8b10d69\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D06T23:45:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D09T01:10:58.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22Social Commerce\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We appreicate your feedback on the Galaxy Watch Ultra, Tubalou. We always look forward to getting insights from our customers. With the new One UI, powered by an all\u002Dnew processor, the Galaxy Watch Ultra is designed to support you on every adventure. Gear up for any expedition with a variety of band options for all terrains. We\x27re glad to see that you enjoyed the screen and responsiveness of the Watch. We noted your concerns about the watch being heavy for you. If you have any further concerns or questions, please do not hesitate to reach out to us at Samsung Support. \u002DKelvin\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D09\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Pennsylvania\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zlwgoljyal3a7kkz7s163jrqc6\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:3,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D06\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I bought this as part of the Black Friday promotion to replace my Watch 5 Pro. I was looking for some of the additional sensor capabilities and accuracy. I do like the ease of changing bands and found inexpensive adapters that allowed using the 20mm bands from my former watches. \\n\\nThe screen looks great and it is responsive. However, after wearing it for a day I had to return it. It was so heavy that it actually hurt my wrist and started to make my hand numb. It also won\x27t work with the watch faces I bought for my earlier watch, but I could have lived with that.  I really wanted to like this, but I\x27m sticking with my 5 Pro for now.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Too heavy and uncomfortable\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Tubalou\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Over11\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2211+\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x