002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D16\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I purchased this watch to replace the Galaxy Watch Pro 5.   Good move by me.  I loved my previous Watch and basically wanted to update for a better health readings and well it also had to have a same or better battery.   I don\x27t even know how to explain it.  But this watch seems.to work much better overall than Old Watch Pro 5.   I mentioned to friends too.  Whatever AI is in this watch in conjunction with the Samsung Ultra 24 phone i have not touched on it much yet.   I wish the BP part would work in the USA.   But I understand you can thank the FDA for not allowing that yet.  Amazing considering a galaxy watch active could do it.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great Large Watch and has nice smooth operation\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Dad2JTK\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235235424\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22ca5257a2\u002Daa13\u002D5ce6\u002Db254\u002Dd6697b387a7d\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T23:00:15.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T23:00:15.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22BossHossgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have owned almost all of the Galaxy watches released.  There was a period of time recently where the battery life and use of the device wasn\x27t as good as it used to be.  I gave the Ultra a shot and so far have been blown away.  It\x27s is very fast, responsive, loud, and best of all, the battery life has been amazingly.  I can easily get 2 full days of decent use including sleep tracking and some workouts.  I haven\x27t had a chance to use all the Galaxy AI features yet but so far it\x27s been good, definitely heading in the right direction.  The size is great, and fits perfectly in my wrist, and the orange band looks really good.  Highly recommend this watch!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Best Galaxy watch yet!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Bosshoss\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235387381\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x225509b958\u002Df393\u002D5529\u002D82ee\u002D39de8aa78811\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D07T02:15:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D07T02:15:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22UltraWatchLovergalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D07\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] It was time to upgrade my device and I chose the ultra. I was used to larger watches so this one was a no brainer.\\n\\nThe functions on the watch are phenomenal! It was even able to detect symptoms of sleep apnea. I was skeptical about wearing it to bed because i thought it would be uncomfortable but I had no problems. There are multiple exercises on it and it prompts me to move around when I\x27ve been sitting too long. I have a few health issues so the watch is great in helping me monitor my heart rate. I\x27m also able to keep up with messages as needed.\\n\\nOver all, this was a good choice. I\x27ve only had it a week but I\x27m excited to learn more about the device.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22I love it!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22UltraWatchLover\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239714851\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x227d87b99d\u002D2f0c\u002D516a\u002D97d6\u002D0ea8b7f5e8fb\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11T23:30:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11T23:30:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Lespaulman72galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I recently upgraded from a Galaxy watch 4 to the new Galaxy Watch Ultra and couldn\x27t be more pleased. From the new easier to swap watch band to the large ergonomic face the Ultra is hands down the best on the market! The information I would have had to scroll through on my Watch 4 to find is now all on the first screen. Health and fitness goals, stress levels, time\/date, battery level, weather information and a compass all on the face with many other options to configure to your needs and liking. Watch faces are easier to obtain with more choices also. A stylish look with larger buttons and a quicker response for device wake up are all much appreciated.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22I\x27d be lost without it.\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Lespaulman72\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236920387\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22f150cd73\u002D7c18\u002D5e86\u002Db374\u002D51ad57c50628\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D21T17:45:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D21T17:45:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium Gray\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Bayshore NY\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22p617sjvp3iqy9if1e79j5ejhh\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D21\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22My 1st smart watch ever. Its a little big but i really like it. The band not so much its not that flexible and wont sit nice on the wireless charger i have to put something ontop of it to make sure it charges over night. Dont know if its the charger or watch but if its the watch the housing needs to be redesigned to allow use of wireless chargers. Many features. i dont trully know how to use it 100% yet but am learning samsung sends updates every know and then. So far i love the ease of use. Am a blue collar worker so not having to take my phone out of my pocket with very dirty or greasy hands its great i just look at my wrist when i get a notification.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x221st time smart watch owner\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Guzman reviews\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Over11\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2211+\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Beginner\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\