w Watch Ultra. With the Watch Ultra, you can gear up for every expedition with a range of band options for all terrains. We do have other bands available that you will love. If you have any concerns or concerns, please reach out to us at Samsung Support. \u002DKelvin\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D09\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Crawford county Ohio\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zpf66rzrx9z5t6j8kzkv2q7sxu\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:3,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D04\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I love the features but it is WAY bigger than my galaxy classic 4 which was 46mm and this is only 47mm! Also I ABSOLUTELY HATE the band that came with it!! It\x27s either too tight or too loose. There\x27s no happy place and it\x27s extremely frustrating and uncomfortable. I have pretty average size wrists and measured and went with the appropriate band size as i was right in the middle of the md\/lrg size. I can\x27t wait for more bands to be released to see if that will help, that is if I decide to keep it because it\x27s enormous and expensive. Plus why is it that I cannot access FB messenger on this watch but yet it tells me my temperature?!?\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Mixed and really unsure for the amount I spent\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Barbara959\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Intermediate\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22orta\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22bir aydan daha az\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235305831\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x220f7ea569\u002D744c\u002D541a\u002D85f1\u002D3f952fb2d929\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D02T14:15:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D02T14:15:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22PH73EXgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D02\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I was skeptical about buying something new but after receiving and setting up the watch it really changed my thoughts. The setup was simple all my previous settings linked up directly from my old watch. The battery life is exceptionally well, it last all day without needing to be charged. The health monitors in this watch are amazing tracking sleep, a snore detection, heart rate and overall health. I can track a multitude of exercises throughout the day. The display and backlight is exceptional clear and the faces give you many options to display on the watch. Can\x27t wait to upgrade to the S24 Ultra soon to get the full experience.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Best Watch Device!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22PH73EX\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239086957\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x221143e047\u002D77e3\u002D5702\u002Db8d2\u002D1b4c52e50c97\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D15T00:15:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D15T00:15:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium Gray\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22St Louis MO\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22t8077xz16b9dgek1kt2ftdq5w\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D14\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I traded in the first generation Galaxy watch for this one. It is as advanced as you might expect. Easy to learn and personalize. Lots of nice features. I would give it 5 stars, except the battery is disappointing. My old watch, even after 8 years, would still go from 6am until 10 pm the next night. I thought the new watch would have a better battery, but it only lasted about 28 hours before it went into power saving, and shut off completely about 7pm the second night. Perhaps my expectations were unrealistic, but I thought it would last longer than an 8 year old watch. Other than that, I do love everything else about this watch.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great watch.\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Jon H\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Intermediate\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22orta\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x221to3mos\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x221\u002D3 ay\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimens