22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22When I first seen the watch on line, I was like, Man I don\x27t like the square body, however once I recieved the watch and started wearing it, was I wrong, I absolutely love the look.  Sure it is a little heavier than the Classic 6, does not bother me in the least. \\n\\nI tried out the sleep apena feature and as my wife thought it let me know that I need to speak to my DR about sleep apena.\\n\\nOverall the features are great, battery life for me is a little better than the Classic 6, I consider myself a moderate to heavy user.\\n\\nSo, was it worth the money, you bet, with the trade for the Classic 6.  If your on the fence, go for it....\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Loving it,\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22REAUSTIN\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x223to5\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x223\u002D5\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Intermediate\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22orta\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22bir aydan daha az\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235230971\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2213ea5700\u002D9bce\u002D5a1a\u002Db080\u002D9a69ea29c4a0\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T21:15:16.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T21:15:16.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ErikMNgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Samsung did it. They brought out a new watch that I couldn\x27t refuse. The look is way more then expected. The screen is vibrant and large, great for someone like me that has vision issues. The rugged and sleek look makes me less worrysome that I have to be careful with my activity.  The smoothness of the graphics are awesome, no latency found going any activities. The connectivity has been spot on, no issues connecting to devices and remaining connected. Being transparent and honest, this is the best watch I have every had and I have had, meets all my needs and wants, and more. Thank you for listening to your customers Samsung and delivering a superiorproduct.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Wow \u002D Samsung Watch Ultra.\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22ErikMN\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236059886\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2249662b6a\u002D86f2\u002D5271\u002Db9a3\u002D90d853300d78\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D09T22:00:07.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D09T22:00:07.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium Gray\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22787b6e249hgoa1hfcoe0n6kxz\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D09\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I really liked my 5 Pro.  But the Ultra,  in my opinion,  is a big step forward.  Mainly,  the battery life.  I\x27ve seen reviews that dis the battery.  But in my experience so far,  the Ultra\x27s battery goes twice as long before I have to charge it.  \\n\\nI also like the square styling of the Ultra, as well as the new band attachment mechanism. \\n\\nMy only complaint is the band itself  It\x27s too short for my wrist and I had to buy an off\u002Dbrand one.  Even the OEM 5 Pro band worked on my wrist,  so I don\x27t know why the Ultra\x27s band is shorter. But that\x27s okay.  I prefer metal bands anyway. I sent the OEM band back for a points credit.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22A Big Improvement From The 5 Pro\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22RFtech53\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235723561\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22ee26e9a5\u002Dd6b2\u002D582f\u002D974f\u002D3c6275a4bab0\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D23T18:00:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D23T18:00:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22IRockSammyProductsgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D23\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The new Samsung Watch Ultra may not be for everybody.. but why not??  I suppose if your cornered\/jailed in that other fruity ecosystem, or you have an itsy bitsy wrist,  this watch may not be a perfect fit. Otherwise, it checks all of the boxes. \\nIt runs Google\x27s and Samsung\x27s latest operating systems, the new watch faces are informative and captivating, the screen face is bright and gorgeous, and the health and wellness information it provides... Just WOW!  And man is it built rugged... Ready for anything outdoors, including the pool or swimming marathons. You can\x27t go wrong with this watch. It should also hold it\x27s value well.  I couldn\x27t be happier with it.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22I Love This Watch and It\x27s Feature Set\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22IRockSammyProducts\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239143912\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22de57529b\u002D2206\u002D5ec3\u002Db300\u002D087349efa678\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D20T20:45:13.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D27T21:35:36.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE (47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAEUA)\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We are thrilled to read that you love your fantastic Galaxy Watch Ultra, and that you think this is the best Samsung watch, Cyril!\\n\\nAs you mentioned, not only does it come in a sleek, fashionable but incredibly durable design, but its performance is also amazing, offering a seamless visual experience with a high refresh rate. \\n\\nAdditionally, we are also glad that you are impressed by its long\u002Dlasting battery life, and that you found it very easy to set up and connect it to your amazing Samsung phone. \\n\\nThis brilliant product is as fashionable as it is functional to help you reach new heights every day! ^CL at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr Integration\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung Customer Experience\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D22\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Chester\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zdcyta8ggk3v40menii39yn8g6\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/bbd424f8\u002D2ba1\u002D41aa\u002D9e56\u002De77161c38797\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/uk\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgrey\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaaeua\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D17\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22This is certainly the best watch produced by Samsung. The design is nice, certainly stand out of the market. The performance is also amazing, the animations just feels so refreshing and good. The battery lasts all\u002Dday and can definitely do atleast 24hrs without charging. Its so easy to set up as well, easy to connect to my phone and use it (mine is a Samsung). And the watch can definitely stand its test, where the previous ones gained scratches over time, this watch will all the abuse it\x27s recieved still looks brand new.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22I Love IT\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22CyrilLJ\x22,\x22Videos\x22:[{\x22VideoCaptionUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/video.api.bazaarvoice.com\/4d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\/video\/movie.vtt\x22,\x22VideoId\x22:\x224d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\x22,\x22VideoHost\x22:\x22BAZAARVOICE\x22,\x22VideoThumbnailUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/video.api.bazaarvoice.com\/4d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\/thumbnail\/image\u002D00001.png\x22,\x22VideoIframeUrl\x22:null,\x22Caption\x22:null,\x22VideoUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/video.api.bazaarvoice.com\/4d5537e0\u002De63d\u002D4f51\u002Dab3d\u002D4b7f0654ff31\/video\/movie.mp4\x22,\x22VideoTypeCode\x22:\x22M\x22,\x22VideoType\x22:\x22mp4\x22}],\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:1,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239840193\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x228e7c1397\u002Da782\u002D5dd9\u002D8406\u002Db06e96977c63\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D19T16:45:13.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D19T16:45:13.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Insitugalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D17\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The **Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra** is the real deal for anyone who wants a smartwatch that can handle anything. It’s made of titanium, super tough, and has a screen that looks amazing, even in direct sunlight. Plus, it’s super fast—no lag at all—and the battery lasts forever (up to 5 days if you don’t go crazy with notifications!).\\n\\nThe best part? It’s packed with features: heart rate monitoring, blood oxygen tracking, and even sleep analysis. If you’re into fitness, it’s your ultimate workout buddy with tons of exercise modes, and it’s water\u002D and dust\u002Dresistant like a champ. Sure, it’s a bit pricey, but if you want a watch that does it all, this is your go\u002Dto.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22The best smart watch ever\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Insitu\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235220704\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22a95c0303\u002Dfc44\u002D5c69\u002Da0d3\u002D8ae70007db5f\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T16:37:43.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29T16:37:43.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Virginia\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zmk9hetgkbfey6m9dmw505mvfc\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22After trying for over a week and going back and fourth between Tmobile and Samsung,  my watch ultra is finally activated as a standalone watch! Both Tmobile and Samsung need to figure out a more efficient way to allow the watch to operate as standalone. Samsung says the watch is standalone, Tmobile continues to tell customers no Samsung watch manufactured after 2018 will work as standalone ( yet they advertise standalone plans). Anywhere, Tmobile finally figured it out and my watch now fully functions as standalone ( as it should, as advertised). I am enjoying the watch, thus far. Samsung, please have a meeting with Tmobile\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Updated Review\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22TWHL\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22V