dXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Watch Ultra impresses with its rugged design, excellent build quality, and comprehensive health\u002Dtracking features, making it a strong choice for fitness enthusiasts and adventurers. It offers an extended battery life, bright and responsive AMOLED display, and advanced GPS capabilities, making it ideal for outdoor use. The interface is smooth and user\u002Dfriendly, integrating well with Samsung\x27s ecosystem, while also supporting various third\u002Dparty apps. However, the watch’s size might feel bulky for some, and it\x27s priced on the higher end, but its performance and durability make it a worthwhile investment for those seeking a premium smartwatch experience\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22I just love it\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Gowda007\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22238612783\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22f7073377\u002D45e5\u002D5d34\u002D9033\u002Dc371ff9cff53\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_ca\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D30T05:45:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D02T21:27:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAXAC)\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22Samsung Support Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Hello, thank you for your review and feedback. We will pass your comments along to our staff. If there is anything we can do to improve your experience, please feel free to let us know by contacting us at 1\u002D800\u002DSAMSUNG or via live chat on our website (http:\/\/www.samsung.com\/ca\/support\/). Thanks again.\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D02\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung Canada\x22}],\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22m9qs5bvp3kwvhs8nm50u13ytt\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_CA\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/0690814c\u002D9d30\u002D44af\u002D81ab\u002Dfd424a3f2a5a\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/ca\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaaxac\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung Canada\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:3,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D30\x22,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[\x22Pro\x22,\x22Con\x22],\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22The bad, Disappointing battery performance. After just over a month with this watch I\x27m very disappointed with the battery life, I\x27m only getting 1 to 1 1\/2 days battery life with aod turned off and using stock watch faces. The charging is very slow, over an hour to recharge. The missing spinning bezel was a major design flaw \/ oversight on Samsung\x27s part. Replacement Samsung bands are ridiculously expensive.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe good, The watch operates flawlessly otherwise, snappy and bright. comes in handy controlling my s24 ultra and receiving notifications. Health monitoring has been a huge improvement over my past Samsung watches.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Design is great, colors are ok, battery sucks\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Beatbreak\x22,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{\x22Con\x22:{\x22Values\x22:[\x22Did not meet expectations\x22],\x22Id\x22:\x22Con\x22,\x22Label\x22:\x22Katkılar\x22},\x22Pro\x22:{\x22Values\x22:[\x22Bright display\x22,\x22Durable\x22],\x22Id\x22:\x22Pro\x22,\x22Label\x22:\x22Ürünler\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordList\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235756772\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22afa11677\u002De473\u002D55ef\u002Db8e1\u002Dbe8374e6a1d7\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D25T12:15:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D25T12:15:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Watchwarrior47galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D25\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Having the very first samsung watch to now the Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 Ultra it is a powerful companion for health\u002Dconscious individuals. With its advanced heart rate monitoring capabilities, it can accurately track your cardiovascular health throughout the day and night which is great for people who may suffer from atrial fibrillation. Its robust activity tracking features make it ideal for fitness enthusiasts, allowing you to monitor your steps, calories burned, and sleep quality. Plus, its seamless integration with the Galaxy S24 Ultra ensures a cohesive and convenient user experience, providing real\u002Dtime notifications and data syncing between the two devices.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Galaxy Titan\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Watchwarrior47\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235251262\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x228a8a2c99\u002D332a\u002D5d63\u002Dbd83\u002D6b4d218a8a97\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T17:15:18.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T17:15:18.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22WalkAndBikeDCgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This watch has been great for fitness. I mostly run and bike so the improved GPS has been a plus. Recognizes my location way faster. I love the look of the watch. Not too big for my wrist and I chose the more understated grey\/black color bands.\\n\\nOnly disappointment was that the case was scratched within a week of my purchase. I\x27m not even sure when it happened, but I was surprised as the case is supposed to be titanium. Also some of the orange paint was chipped on the face. This has not hindered the use of the watch but if I were doing more rugged sports, I suppose it\x27d be a badge of honor. But as a casual athlete, I wish it had resisted scratching more readily.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Love the look! Scratched too easily\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22WalkAndBikeDC\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22242991261\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22f8238112\u002D21d3\u002D5042\u002Db64c\u002Dc3b736f4409f\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D07\u002D01T14:45:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D07\u002D01T14:45:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ItswatchU4megalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I love my Samsung Galaxy watch ultra. I always upgrade to the flagship model each year. I wasn\x27t sure that I would like giving up the rotating bezel from the classic series last year but surprisingly I haven\x27t missed it. I do love that this model is different and distinctive and I\x27m often asked about it in public. I do love the watch band class or pin system. It\x27s very convenient for someone like me who changes watch bands almost daily. I love having all of my health information integrated so that I can see everything at a glance. Getting set up for workouts and auto detection features work flawlessly I have no complaints.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Love the style and feature set\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22ItswatchU4me\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235482580\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x224f14c3a4\u002Db4a2\u002D5927\u002D9b50\u002Dbaacd65982cd\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T19:30:17.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T19:30:17.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Hebro50galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Coming from the watch4 44mm,  I knew that the galaxy watch 7ultra would be an up grade, but oh my, this watch blew my sock of and is still impressing me, especially with the AI in the health and fitness. The cushion case is a breath of fresh air. I hope you have a patent on this lug system, it\x27s the best ever made, no pins to scratch the inner lugs, and so much easier to change out, samsung went above and beyond on making this watch. Can\x27t forget about the titanium casing, it\x27s classy and rugged at the same time, you slap a on marine band to do your out door stuff,  or go out on the town with a trail band. Over all with the AI samsung has built a master piece. 👍\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22This watch blew my socks off.\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Hebro50\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239532392\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22805908a7\u002Db993\u002D5601\u002Da1e3\u002D2c76562cc236\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D05T21:45:08.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D20T04:21:31.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium Silver\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Hi there Karim, \\nThanks for sharing your experience with using your Galaxy Watch Ultra. Your feedback is valuable as we continue our journey to bring our consumers the best in design and functionality. The Galaxy Watch Ultra offers up to 100 hours of battery life when in Power saving mode, up to 48 hours in Exercise power saving mode, and up to 60 hours of battery life without Power Saving mode. This is based on typical usage so results may vary. There are several reasons why your Galaxy Watch may be experiencing battery drain or have decreased battery life. For instance, certain apps can increase battery consumption. Please take a moment to review, \\\x22Reduced battery life on your Samsung smart watch\\\x22 when you have the available time to learn about how you can increase your watch battery life. Also check out, \\\x22Clear the app cache and data on your Galaxy phone or tablet\\\x22 and \\\x22Use Samsung Health sleep monitoring on your Galaxy Watch\\\x22 to help resolve what you have described to be experiencing with your health tracking features. I have also included the link to your device manual for your review. Let us know if you have any questions for us after checking those out by reaching out to Samsung Support. We\x27d be happy to assist you further. Thank you for choosing Samsung!\\n\u002D Debra \\n\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nhttps:\/\/smsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\/\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/support\/troubleshooting\/TSG01003232\/\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/support\/answer\/ANS10001372\/\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/support\/answer\/ANS10003657\/\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/support\/downloads\/\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D06\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22VA, USA\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zb4yn7o2fo29bz4hsjtpx2c8mi\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:1,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D04\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22Do not waste your money on the Galaxy Watch Ultra. This so\u002Dcalled \\\x22premium\\\x22 smartwatch is nothing but an overpriced piece of garbage. The battery life is absolutely terrible—it barely lasts a day on a full charge. And to make matters worse, it takes a ridiculous 4 hours to charge back up.\\n\\nThe health tracking features? Completely unreliable. The heart rate monitor, sleep tracker, and other health options are far from accurate, making them pretty much useless. If you\x27re expecting a smartwatch that can actually help with fitness tracking, look elsewhere.\\n\\nSamsung really dropped the ball with this one. Save yourself the frustration and invest in a better alternative.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22A Complete Waste of Money\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Karim\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x221to3mos\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x221\u002D3 ay\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235290163\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x228ecd0f86\u002D5d48\u002D5c48\u002D867c\u002D03f9357a9241\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D05T17:00:20.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D26T11:20:38.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Thank you for sharing your experience with us, Daniel. Your feedback is always needed as we continue to make improvements to our products and services. We see that you are reaching out regarding your new Samsung Galaxy Ultra. Our watches are for everyone! We understand that you are having some concerns over whether your tattoos are interfering with your watch sensor. Samsung offers a 12\u002Dmonth limited warranty for manufacturer defects. If the watch is too loose, or the sensor is dirty, it may have difficulty tracking your steps and heart rate. We recommend that you clean the watch and make sure it\x27s properly fitted to get the best results. If this persists, please reach out to us at Samsung Support so that we can look into a resolution for this. \u002DKelvin\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D01\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Florida\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22z6mlrbday1e68qxnunhpaxr4l4\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zq4txf1ujiri8nt8dmegwewgaf\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D19T18:29:50.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zdzhk7k8df5c20mkjsxu4fdlkg\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D17T10:10:43.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zppfhphso04w9r0yw26tgf7nq8\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D02T15:40:44.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22z6q7sq4wugkin5go0plagkutth\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D02T04:08:12.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ztksrejj2jitikn81eona4msdu\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D10T08:48:46.000+00:00\x22},{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ziovuid64canx5k3s95xeoe6m0\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D04T23:10:19.000+00:00\x22}],\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:6,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:1,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D01\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I received my Galaxy 7 ultra watch and was very excited. It\x27s a beuatiful watch and I did have problems with it when I used some of it\x27s features. I have several tattoos on my arms and the heart rate monitor won\x27t work it always tells me to scoot the watch down. No matter how many times I do this it won\x27t work. When I go to use the tutorial for the gestures it keeps telling me to put watch on when I clearly have it on. I really hope yall can fix this and I didn\x27t waste money on this expensive watch and not be able to use all the features. I put the watch on my wife who has no tattoos on her arm and the watch worked fine.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Doesn\x27t work with tattoos\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Anonymous\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Intermediate\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22orta\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22bir aydan daha az\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22242354718\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2203ae2d56\u002Dd238\u002D5f61\u002D90aa\u002D1bec816e72fc\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D03T21:30:19.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D03T21:30:19.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Willardgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D02\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Samsung has redefined what a premium smartwatch can be with the Galaxy Watch Ultra—a rugged, intelligent, and beautifully crafted wearable that doesn’t just track time, but enhances your life in subtle, powerful ways. Blending premium design with cutting\u002Dedge performance and AI\u002Denhanced features, this watch is a serious contender in the world of ultra\u002Dsmart wearables. What truly sets the Watch Ultra apart is its integration with Galaxy AI, Samsung’s new on\u002Ddevice artificial intelligence engine. This is not just AI for show—it’s seamlessly woven into the experience, improving utility, personalization, and daily insights.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Excellent product\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Willard\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22237711471\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x224c2526eb\u002Da457\u002D53b3\u002Da80a\u002D7f05de929576\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D11\u002D26T04:00:03.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D11\u002D26T04:00:03.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium White\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Connecticut\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22z7fxtuccudxka4ktzqggh3deiw\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D11\u002D26\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I had the Watch 6 classic prior to this, and I was nervous reading some of the reviews regarding battery life.  My watch 6 only really ever got a day, maybe a day and a half of use, so I was skeptical this would last.  I\x27m happy to say the other reviews weren\x27t correct, and the battery life in the Ultra is amazing.  I get 3 days with regular use before I have to charge it.  Overall, this is a great watch, however, I\x27m giving it 4 stars, due to not getting full functionality unless you also have a Samsung phone.  I have a Sony Xperia, and the amount I spent on this watch, I should get full functionality.  So be warned if you have anything other than a Samsung phone.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great battery life.\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22ATL69\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Over11\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2211+\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x221to3mos\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x221\u002D3 ay\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236779723\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22c8a796c1\u002D1a3e\u002D5511\u002D97dd\u002D66b33c027290\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D14T23:00:05.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D14T23:00:05.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22cano14galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D14\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] In my professional opinion, as a seasoned user of various fitness tracking devices, I must commend the Samsung Ultra for its exceptional features. The accuracy of its tracking capabilities, particularly in monitoring energy levels, is truly remarkable. Unlike other brands that I have tried, which provided inconsistent sleep tracking data, the Samsung Ultra stands out for its precision. This has undoubtedly made me a loyal Samsung enthusiast, surpassing my previous admiration for other brands. Samsung has truly excelled with the Ultra, delivering a device that combines style, color, and exceptional tracking capabilities.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Best watch ever!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22cano14\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235484797\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x228435836f\u002D2f96\u002D55a4\u002D9169\u002D4de30578d6a2\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T20:15:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T20:15:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Watchdudegalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really like this watch. Mostly because it looks cool. The look of this watch makes up for it\x27s few weaknesses; for example it\x27s not comfortable. It also won\x27t charge on a flat charger like my Samsung Trio. However, because it looks so cool, I\x27m OK with the discomfort and the inconvenience. It also had AI. The AI comes in real handy, when you need it. I love the big screen, typing of a watch was never easy, but on the Ultra, it is very easy. I like the new extra button, it\x27s nice to quickly start mr workout. The orange is very sophisticated. I like knowing it\x27s super durable,  I don\x27t feel like I need to be careful,  I just do am live and I\x27m confident it\x27ll be OK.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22This watch is cool\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Watchdude\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22242545535\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22c7014c33\u002D02d5\u002D57f7\u002D9d2e\u002D2a64fa17460b\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D11T12:45:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D11T12:45:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Glow8Gurlgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D10\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I originally purchased this watch for tracking my sleep and measure my body composition, but I didn\x27t know how much easier it would be to communicate and be able to answer calls when I\x27m away from my phone and see messages and determine whether or not they need to be answered right away or not. I can be away from my phone for long periods of time, so it\x27s good that I can see my day notifications. Galaxy AI makes it so easy for me to do touch free or communicate touch free when im getting my hands dirty or just dont want to get my phone to do it.  I love my watch and I think I\x27m going to keep it around for a long time.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Everything about it is perfect\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Glow8Gurl\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239716764\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22c1abc39a\u002Dd42f\u002D5653\u002D82dc\u002Dd5fe044e7fe4\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11T23:30:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11T23:30:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Androidfaithfulgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have very labor intensive work daily.\\nI purchased this device to be able to track my physical activity while staying connected to my family \x26 important information I would normally receive on my phone.....\\nMy 1st task upon purchased was to include screen protectors, case protection, etc.  anticipating potential damage because of my work.\\nWell aside from All of my preparation for disaster; I have dropped, stepped on, \x26 all but submerged this watch in fire \x26 ice, and I tell you, not even a hiccup.\\nFrom complete skeptic, to total believer.\\nPurchased bands for every occasion and literally is the only item I wear daily.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22The durability of this product is very impressive\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Androidfaithful\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22243854093\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x223017938d\u002D7578\u002D5ae4\u002D8889\u002Da874197814c5\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D25T02:30:05.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D25T02:30:05.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra, 47mm, Titanium Gray\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Iowa\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22owh5lhhrsrfjwmudzd6bpe3zl\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22z9wsz1tw810v7dbm0rul7lmnjm\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D25T02:01:35.000+00:00\x22}],\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:1,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:4,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D07\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I bought this mainly for the longer charge this watch holds, compared to my older Galaxy Watch 6 that would run out the battery in less than a day. The new Galaxy Watch Ultra lasts me almost 2 days (depending on if I use it for working out or not) before having to charge it again! The only downfall is just how bulky it is, so when I do do exercises that has me down on my hands, if my wrist bends at all, it will hit the main button and it has stopped my workout session early. This has happened a couple times now, so I usually slide it down my arm a little when I do those exercises. It\x27s just annoying, but not a deal breaker for me. Overall, very happy with my purchase!!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Awesome battery power \x26 lots of features!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Karah\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x223to5\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x223\u002D5\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},