vdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D04\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] So let\x27s start with the software and how smooth it is. Very snappy and responsive. I must say that I\x27m actually impressed with the watch faces from Samsung. I truly hope they continue to produce more watch faces because they are amazing. I love the ability to customize the faces even down to a granular level. The screen size is perfect, the build is substantial, the feel of the watch on my wrist if perfect. If your coming from any of the classics it\x27s does feel like an upgrade. I miss the rotating bezel but honestly it\x27s not a deal breaker for me. I\x27m actually excited to wear my watch again. This is not just another incremental update it\x27s a major change and I love it.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Way better in person!!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Chevyrida79\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235791623\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22a378fa27\u002D0d9b\u002D50e4\u002Db4df\u002Dbf2f2bf995fe\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D26T22:15:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D26T22:15:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Jbald111galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D26\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I am very impressed with my Galaxy Watch Ultra.   Battery life is exceptional,  and I think it\x27s the best looking Galaxy watch yet. \\nThe AI aspect of the watch is next level and the health sensors are remarkable. \\nI can do an EEG, step counting is accurate,   a close blood OX reading,  heart rate,  and a lot more I haven\x27t had a chance to check out. \\nI currently only use my watch by Bluetooth connecting with my phone but when I can pay for the data plan will be excited about stand alone calls with my watch only. \\nOver all I think this watch is worth the money.   \\nI wear it all day and night.   \\n\\nVery happy customer!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Best looking with the best tech watch\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Jbald111\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235252643\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22f7ded948\u002Dc424\u002D5fe2\u002Da0d4\u002D6ca0ccc2dd2f\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T18:00:13.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T18:00:13.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Pharr, texas\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zowoj9ob9c3xiw9tet4imqzwb0\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22I just get mine yesterdayand overall to me the weight is perfect I have big hands and I can text on this one, I trade I. The 5 pro and this one is 10 time better, the battery last right now in my second day and still have 50% I didn\x27t ajust nothing so the battery las a lot.... play a bit with faces love it, audio is strong, the alarm ia crazy loud, the brightness is to strong some times but you can see the screen perfectly on day light, the watch bands this time are large enough for me.... the temperature sensor works too, the action button can be better but for now I just set the flashlight in double tap, perfect for night if you wake up, is the perfect watch....10\/10\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22THE WATCH....\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Sephy76\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22bir aydan daha az\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22239715855\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22f1636fa8\u002D63fe\u002D5743\u002Db3dd\u002D465a95282395\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11T21:00:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11T21:00:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x223Bclovergalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D02\u002D11\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Ultra Watch has it all! I am impressed with how seamless and fluid it is to transition from one app to the other or when I\x27m exercising how easy it is to choose what I\x27m doing. Along with the ease of setting controls, I love the quick button. I have mine set for running when double pressed so I can start sooner. The face of the Watch is also a plus not to big and not to small. I can text or swipe text with ease. The volume is excellent as well when I\x27m on call and or just listing to my favorite podcast, I\x27m not struggling to hear what is being said. Overall  im very satisfied with the Galaxy Watch Ultra.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22My Galaxy Ultra Watch Review!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x223Bclover\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235257322\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2288522ec7\u002Dd43a\u002D5d8e\u002D964b\u002Df251885e2a29\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T21:45:21.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D31T23:17:12.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We highly value your candid feedback. It is essential for us to hear from our customers about their experience with our devices. We are pleased that you have reached out to share your thoughts on the new Watch7. We hope that you continue to enjoy your watch as we remain committed to improving our service and products. If you have any other concerns or inquiries, do not hesitate to contact us at Samsung Support.\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D31\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Jddd221galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:3,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This watch does have great features that i yet have to explore.  But there are some otems i would change. I was not a fan of the round screen as i feel to much screen is lost due to this. The round bezel on top is no longer spinnable which was kind of a bummer. I feel like the orange main button should be customizable instead of just having it for working out. I also feel like the sleep sensor is a little worse then the previous i was able to get better reading on my old watch. I did like the function of more possibilities of apps. The color itself is nice wpuld have loved a olive green style more this seems as a derivative of the competition.  Overall its an okay watch\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Pros and Cons\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Jddd221\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22237104975\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x227914fc15\u002D16d3\u002D520e\u002D908e\u002Dc4389e50c1a7\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D31T22:45:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D31T22:45:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Willowgalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I\x27m new to smart watches. I began my my first journey with the Samsung Ultra watch just a few months ago. I have to say I enjoy all Samsung products. Yet this watch is so helpful in more ways than one, two, or three because it has light weight feel plus durability. Functions are easy to navigate and the docent watch faces are brilliantly innovative with design and smart technology. One of my favorites is the ability to support endangered animals. for the support they give you a watch face which I wear proudly. So many functions. And programming is as easy because I can do it from my phone also.  Thank you Samsung🫡\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22My ultra watch\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Willow\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236200070\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x224ac31f5c\u002Df52d\u002D57d9\u002D835c\u002D5d28792cb08e\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D16T21:00:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D16T21:00:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE (47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAEUA)\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22Age\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Ilford\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_3188249\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D16\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The watch finally arrived last week. Have been testing back and forth. These are the finding I found about it:\u002D\\n\\nPROS\\n+ Nice Big Display\\n+ Battery life amazingly good\\n+ Calling and Messaging , very easy to pair up with my phone and also use as a standalone phone on the go\\n\\nThe Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra is a watch available right now if you require full WearOS platform access, excellent GPS accuracy, and a longer battery life. In terms of training heart rate, it\x27s a little hit or miss (maybe it was me). When I ran and rode indoors, I found it to be fairly accurate. Overall satisfied and would recommend this watch.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Samsung Galaxy Smart Watch 7 Ultra\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Magick20\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22Age\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x2235to44\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Age\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2235 \u002D 44\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Yaş\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235473619\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x227ffafe86\u002D08d6\u002D5495\u002D9245\u002Dfd764db05966\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T19:30:16.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D15T10:32:47.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE (47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAEUA)\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22Age\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Thank you for reviewing the Galaxy Watch Ultra! With powerful performance, this incredible watch can handle all your daily needs, and them some! Allowing to track all your health and activity goals, keep in contact with friends and family and use the wide range of useful apps and features! \\n\\nThe beautiful design is customisable, allowing you not only enjoy comfort, but also a look that suits you own personal style! \\n\\nAlthough we\x27re sorry that you miss the rotting bezel, we know you are going to thorough enjoy you new watch every single day, for many years to come! ^CR at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22SamsungUK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D15\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Aberdeen\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_2300034\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have had the Galaxy Ultra for a week now and i am really impressed with its performance .\\nThe first thing i noticed when i opened the box was the build quality which is really impressive.The watch has so many options to personalise the watch faces and functions.\\nI like using my watch to track my fitness and sleep which the ultra does with great accuracy.\\nThe only negative with the Ultra is it doesn\x27t have the rotating bezel which is on the Galaxy 6 watch.This is a minor thing though.All in I would  recommend  the ultra to anyone that is interested in keeping an eye on their fitness progress and quality of sleep\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Excellent Smart Watch\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Gordon163\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22Age\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x2255to64\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Age\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2255 \u002D 64\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Yaş\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235957240\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2271b026d7\u002Dd116\u002D575a\u002Db411\u002D34847786b966\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D06T02:00:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D06T02:00:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ViperN226galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D04\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The battery life has absolutely amazed me going from my galaxy watch 4 classic I had no idea what I was missing. I only ever charge the watch when I shower and it is always above 50%. if you are worried about it being an inconvenience to charge do not worry. the amount of features always surprises me on my watch, from my detailed sleep patterns so the large variety of workouts that you can select. the watch frame is also very strong. I have nicked it on many surfaces to find that there are still no scratches or dents at all but on the other objects like the desk I bumped it on.I am very impressed with this watch.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Amazing battery life and great features\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22ViperN226\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235243677\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22f650f8b7\u002Da457\u002D58b9\u002Db393\u002D44a38e5ee184\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T08:45:04.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30T16:00:31.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Hi! Thank you for reaching out to leave your review. Your feedback is essential to us as we strive to enhance our products and services. It seems that you want to share your experience with the Galaxy Watch Ultra. The Galaxy AI features on the Galaxy Watch7 and Galaxy Watch Ultra bring improved sleep tracking options and workout routines. You can try marathon workouts like triathlons, receive detailed analyses of your current health and wellness with energy scores, and monitor your sleep patterns. Additionally, you\x27ll have access to AI communication features that allow you to summarize in\u002Dperson conversations and quickly respond to messages. If you have any further concerns or questions, do not hesitate to reach out to us at Samsung Support. \u002DKelvin\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22BigLA23galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:3,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D30\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] PLEASE STAY AWAY!  If you own Galaxy Watch 4 or later, DO NOT UPGRADE if you like watch face NOT from samsung. Even \\\x22Galaxy AI\\\x22 is not worth upgrading for and a total disappointment. This new watch will not let you use the same watch faces you have been using, even if you have used the same faces on every watch since Watch Active 2. And Galaxy AI is a joke. It\x27s the same thing you get on older models with the updated OS. I would say upgrade if you own Watch 3 or earlier, but even then, go to the Watch 5 Pro. I\x27m regretting the trade in. Also, the square dial is GARBAGE. If we wanted a square watch, we would get another brand watch. If you upgrade, you WILL be disappointed\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Worst Watch Upgrade\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22BigLA23\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235824114\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22d4504e17\u002D3571\u002D5194\u002Da413\u002Ddc915bfe3078\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D28T14:00:06.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D30T10:38:54.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE (47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAAEUA)\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22Age\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We are thrilled to read that you have upgraded your Samsung Ecosystem to the next level with the addition of the fantastic Galaxy Watch Ultra! \\n\\nIt is great that you were pleasantly surprised by the convenient size and design of this fantastic watch, which you found to be very similar to your previous Galaxy Watch5 Pro, and which made transitioning onto the new product easy and smooth. \\n\\nWe are also glad that you are overall satisfied with the battery life of this powerful device, and that you found setting it up and using it straightforward and smart from the start. \\n\\nFurthermore, we are delighted that you like the clear and bright screen, as well as its advanced fitness tracking features, which help you always stay on top of your health and workout goals. \\n\\nFinally, it makes us very happy to read that you would recommend this incredible watch, which is packed with the absolute best of Samsung technology to deliver an excellent experience every day. ^CL at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22SamsungUK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D30\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22HALIFAX\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_3935419\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D28\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Samsung watch ultra is big, bold and feature packed. \\nI have had my watch 5 pro for a couple of years now and was wary the ultra would be too big in comparison but it really is about the same (I have a case on the pro) so I was pleasantly surprised.\\nI am getting 2 days with the always on mode and 4\/5 with raise to wake.\\nThe screen is clear and easy to use and set up quick and simple. \\nThe auto tracking features so far seem to work great as it has picked up on all the walks I have been on so far. \\nI would highly recommend this watch to anyone who wants great battery life and an amazing workout health tracker.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Great upgrade for the Samsung ecosystem\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Anonymous\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22Age\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x2235to44\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Age\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2235 \u002D 44\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Yaş\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22241968695\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x227f8f797a\u002Df69b\u002D5730\u002D9bc4\u002D8c026b8a49c2\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D05\u002D20T03:00:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D05\u002D22T15:39:37.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Aloha Liam, \\nThank you for finding the opportunity to share your sentiments with us about your Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra. We value your feedback as we are committed to constant innovation while we strive to improve the design and functionality of our product line. All Galaxy devices have a set temperature range, where they operate at their best. While they may feel warm under certain conditions, like charging, this does not affect the device\x27s lifespan or performance. However, if your devices get too warm, it could cause some issues. Please take a moment to review, \\\x22Keep your Galaxy device at its normal operating temperature\\\x22 to learn some awesome tips on maintaining your device within its perfect temperature threshold to avoid the possibility of overheating. The Peakform Band for Galaxy Watch Ultra is built to handle everyday activities with ease. It’s designed with a soft touch fabric and durable rubber material, allowing you to stay comfortable in any workout you choose, from cycling to jogging. The Marine Band is crafted to meet the performance standards of the new Galaxy Watch Ultra. Its titanium buckle is light and durable, and the wide ripple design is made for easy water drainage and quick sweat drying. The Trail Band for Galaxy Watch Ultra features a lightweight fabric and Triangle Latch and Hook that fit comfortably around your wrist. Suited for trail running and a wide range of workouts, the wide ripple design allows you to push through your activity with ease. Feel free to check out a different band to help create a Bespoke look. If you have any questions for us or if you would like any further assistance, do not hesitate to reach out to Samsung Support. Thank you for being a staunch Samsung customer. \\n\u002D Debra\\n\\nSamsung Support\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nWarranty Information\\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nFacebook Messenger\\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nX Messages\\nhttps:\/\/smsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nSamsung Community\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity\\nKeep your Galaxy device at its normal operating temperature\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/support\/answer\/ANS00076952\/\\nWatch Ultra Peakform Band\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/mobile\u002Daccessories\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dpeakform\u002Dband\u002Dwhite\u002Dsand\u002Det\u002Dsbl70mweguj\/\\nWatch Ultra Marine Band\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/mobile\u002Daccessories\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dmarine\u002Dband\u002Ddark\u002Dgray\u002Det\u002Dsnl70mbeguj\/\\nWatch Ultra Trail Band\\nhttps:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/mobile\u002Daccessories\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtrail\u002Dband\u002Ddark\u002Dgray\u002Det\u002Dsvl70mbeguj\/\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D05\u002D22\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22California\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22hzsdwhdf6of5h1q65lfe8enax\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zpe89kn590bm470zq8wzlva5vb\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D05\u002D19T23:27:49.000+00:00\x22}],\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:1,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dwhite\u002Dsm\u002Dl705uzwaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D05\u002D16\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22This watch is incredible. It does everything I wanted it to do very well. Mileage while running and walking is pretty accurate just from what I\x27ve measured, heart rate while working out on weight machines at the gym is always spot on. Battery life is great at 3 days (including sleep tracking). The device gets warm while charging, but the small magnetic wireless charger is sweet. I only wish it had a usb\u002Dc port on it instead of having a cable come out of it.\\n\\nMy only complaints are that is is a thick boy, it\x27s stand off of my wrist much taller than a regular analog watch. Also, the included strap isn\x27t terrible comfortable, and also bulky. And replacement straps are pricey.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Everything I needed it to be and more\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Liam P\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x223to5\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x223\u002D5\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22bir aydan daha az\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22236327291\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22c39c8d73\u002D10c3\u002D5d25\u002D8ee7\u002D209a4802a5ad\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D22T22:15:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D11\u002D15T02:23:20.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22R\x26R Team\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Hey John! It\x27s great to hear from you! We see that you contacted us to share your feedback on the Galaxy Watch Ultra. Challenge yourself to perform at your peak on your next run or bike ride using tracking with Galaxy AI. If your watch is not tracking your swims correctly we recommend making sure that your watch is up to date with the latest software update available. If you have already done so and this persists, it\x27s best to leave an error report regarding this. To send an error report for your Galaxy Watch, Galaxy Buds, or Galaxy Ring, you\x27ll need to use the Galaxy Wearable app on your connected phone or tablet. Open the Galaxy Wearable app on your phone or tablet. Tap Menu. This may appear as a circle in the bottom center of the screen or three horizontal lines on the left side. Tap More in the upper right. This looks like three vertical dots. Tap Settings, and then tap Contact us at the bottom. Tap Error reports under Send feedback. From the list, select the wearable device(s) you are having issues with to gather the data, and then tap Next. Make sure Send system log data is checked, and then fill out the other required fields. If you wish to include an additional attachment, you can tap the Attach icon which looks like a paper clip in the upper right corner. You can add a photo, screenshot, or voice recording. When you\x27re ready, tap the send arrow in the upper right corner. If you have any further concerns or questions, please reach out to us at Samsung Support. \u002DKelvin\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DSupport \\nsmsng.us\/Facebook\u002DMessenger \\nsmsng.us\/X\u002DMessages\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCommunity \\nsmsng.us\/Warranty\u002DInfo\\nsmsng.us\/Samsung\u002DCare\u002DPlus\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22mc\u002Dapi\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222024\u002D10\u002D01\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22}],\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zetq4ykf87vm7d0ag1dmm3goxy\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:2,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D22\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22The Watch Ultra needs to show correct swim laps when exercising in the pool.\\nI do 74 laps, and it takes around 50\u002D55 minutes. I compared it with Watch6 (the same result for 74 laps done—the watch showed only 48 and 52 \u002D it doesn\x27t show all laps) and another brand (the watch showed all the laps I swam—perfect count of the laps), so it is about 30% incorrect, way too much.\\nIt happened after the last update.\\nAlso, the reading of the calories for Watch6 and Watch Ultra are different.\\nIt is unacceptable for such an expensive watch to show the results of exercise with such big differences.\\n Please correct the problem.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Exercises problem\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22John\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Over11\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2211+\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x221to3mos\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x221\u002D3 ay\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235487406\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2291e5fcc5\u002D50ca\u002D528d\u002Db5c3\u002D18028185512b\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T21:30:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12T21:30:10.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22Ultrauser1galaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D08\u002D12\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Long\u002Dtime user of Android\/Samsung products, especially when it comes to watches. So I\x27ve experienced it from the beginning, and I can say this watch is by far one of my favorites so far. The design is awesome, as well as the battery life! I love how they integrated Galaxy AI into the watch and many other features like sleep score to the action button for workouts! I use this watch every day regardless of the activity. So all in all, there are a lot of improvements and awesome features. I would highly recommend this watch to anyone who enjoys wearing a watch and wants to keep track of their day\u002Dto\u002Dday activities.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Galaxy watch ultra\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Ultrauser1\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235155270\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x222c4f3ee8\u002D38c2\u002D5ab3\u002Dadb6\u002Da1a933eedf42\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D31T01:15:15.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D01\u002D05T01:44:47.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22Expertise\x22,\x22NumberOwned\x22],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22Macon GA\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22jelen\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[{\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22zhk0w0fw105zyfiytd9de18hw5\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D12\u002D28T00:47:08.000+00:00\x22}],\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:1,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D07\u002D26\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22The most \\\x22put together\\\x22 samsung watch I have owned.  I have owned several generations since the 2nd gen samsung smarth watch and this is the best.  Definitely better accuracy on GPS and calorie burn, and it finally looks like it can compete withe the style and feel of larger traditional mechanical watches.  I was concerned the screen was a bit too large, but it actually has allowed me to use features like email and message summary which were too small to be useful on previous models.  With Galaxy AI, it feels like the watch ecosystem has turned a corner in terms of user engagement.  Very happy with the purchase!\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Finally a watch that checks all the boxes!\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22BJMAC\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Over11\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x2211+\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Intermediate\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22orta\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Under1mo\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22bir aydan daha az\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22244345049\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22871022e6\u002Df7a1\u002D5a84\u002D898e\u002D50818578d525\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Den_gb\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D30T14:30:09.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D30T15:55:51.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (2025) (LTE, 47 mm)(SM\u002DL705FZS2EUA)\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22CX\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22We appreciate the time you’ve taken to let us know your wonderful feedback, and we’re thrilled to know you’re loving your Watch Ultra (2025)! ^LB at Samsung Support\x22,\x22ResponseSource\x22:\x22Sprinklr CS Response Prod\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22,\x22Date\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D30\x22,\x22SourceClientName\x22:\x22Samsung UK\x22}],\x22UserLocation\x22:\x22llanelli\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22ti_5381577\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_GB\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/contentorigin.bazaarvoice.com\/theinsiders\/default\/C19_Insiders_PeopleTrustPeople_Logo_Grey.png\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:null,\x22Name\x22:\x22The Insiders\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:1,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22IsRecommended\x22:true,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D08\u002D29\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] So, my first impressions of the Samsung Watch Ultra LTE are that I love it! The functions that you are able to tweak, the different faces, and also, I am not a cyclist or runner, but I am an archer, which you can add to the exercises tab. The health benefits of being able to check on blood pressure and ECG as well to help in managing health are great. The apps that are included when downloaded are streamlined and straightforward, adding an LTE data allowance. I can\x27t wait to put the watch through its paces. Now we have Gemini AI installed also, which can help in searches, menu planning, and other tasks. I can\x27t believe I have not had a watch like this before. Over the moon!\x22,\x22Title