ntLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222024\u002D09\u002D15\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22This is definitely the best Galaxy watch yet, I\x27d argue the best combination smartwatch and fitness device on the market. From a user standpoint, it does everything well. GPS and activity tracking are vastly improved from other iterations I\x27ve had (this is my 8th galaxy watch).  I use the LTE feature and call quality and text messaging work flawlessly.  I was really disappointed there was no option for the rotating bezel, still am, but the screen works really well and I\x27ve had no real issues with it.  The design grows on you by the day, to the point that it works in any situation.  Classy and sporty.  The GWU is just a comprehensive value buy if you\x27re big in Smart watches.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Watch ultra winning\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22Jamal\x22,\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{\x22NumberOwned\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x226to10\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22NumberOwned\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x226\u002D10\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Sahip olduğum SAMSUNG ürün sayısı\x22},\x22Expertise\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x22Expert\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22Expertise\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x22uzman\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Uzmanlık\x22},\x22UsedProduct\x22:{\x22Value\x22:\x221to3mos\x22,\x22Id\x22:\x22UsedProduct\x22,\x22ValueLabel\x22:\x221\u002D3 ay\x22,\x22DimensionLabel\x22:\x22Bu ürünü şu kadar süre kullandım\x22}},\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],