tPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x222 years ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22243138488\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x22ab534a7e\u002D865e\u002D5707\u002Dad7d\u002D404a13d43332\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D07\u002D08T00:00:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222025\u002D07\u002D08T00:00:11.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FDAATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra LTE\x22,\x22AuthorId\x22:\x22GerryFromSalisburygalaxysweeps\x22,\x22ContentLocale\x22:\x22en_US\x22,\x22IsFeatured\x22:false,\x22TotalInappropriateFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsSyndicated\x22:true,\x22SyndicationSource\x22:{\x22ClientId\x22:null,\x22LogoImageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/photos\u002Dus.bazaarvoice.com\/photo\/2\/cGhvdG86YXR0cmlidXRpb25sb2dvMg\/3f0db944\u002D7f1f\u002D456d\u002Dac37\u002D2291be7453fa\x22,\x22ContentLink\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/us\/mobile\/wearables\/smartwatches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002D47mm\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dsm\u002Dl705udaaxaa\/\x22,\x22Name\x22:\x22Samsung US\x22},\x22TotalClientResponseCount\x22:0,\x22TotalCommentCount\x22:0,\x22Rating\x22:5,\x22IsRatingsOnly\x22:false,\x22ModerationStatus\x22:\x22APPROVED\x22,\x22SubmissionTime\x22:\x222025\u002D07\u002D07\x22,\x22ReviewText\x22:\x22[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The Galaxy Watch Ultra is amazing! It\x27s actually more watch than I need, but it is so worth it. The first thing I noticed was the band attachment. Great upgrade from previous models. It makes changing bands painless. The face of the watch appears to be bigger, but compared to the 5, it\x27s about the same.The functionality is seamless from one model to the next. The only feature that I haven\x27t been able to achieve was the double pinch to wake the watch up or take a photo. I\x27m sure I\x27ll get it figured out. Overall, I can always depend on Samsung to have a solid mobile phone and watch. They haven\x27t let me down yet.\x22,\x22Title\x22:\x22Excellent Purchase\x22,\x22UserNickname\x22:\x22GerryFromSalisbury\x22,\x22SecondaryRatings\x22:{},\x22ContextDataValuesOrder\x22:[],\x22Cons\x22:null,\x22SecondaryRatingsOrder\x22:[],\x22ClientResponses\x22:[],\x22Helpfulness\x22:null,\x22TagDimensionsOrder\x22:[],\x22BadgesOrder\x22:[],\x22AdditionalFields\x22:{},\x22AdditionalFieldsOrder\x22:[],\x22TotalPositiveFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22UserLocation\x22:null,\x22Photos\x22:[],\x22ProductRecommendationIds\x22:[],\x22IsRecommended\x22:null,\x22Pros\x22:null,\x22InappropriateFeedbackList\x22:[],\x22RatingRange\x22:5,\x22CommentIds\x22:[],\x22ContextDataValues\x22:{},\x22Badges\x22:{},\x22CampaignId\x22:null,\x22TotalFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22TagDimensions\x22:{},\x22SubmissionId\x22:null,\x22Videos\x22:[],\x22TotalNegativeFeedbackCount\x22:0,\x22IsTranslateYN\x22:\x22Y\x22,\x22ProductPageName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FDAATUR)\x22,\x22ProductPageUrl\x22:\x22https:\/\/www.samsung.com\/tr\/watches\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\/galaxy\u002Dwatch\u002Dultra\u002Dtitanium\u002Dgray\u002Dlte\u002Dsm\u002Dl705fdaatur\/\x22,\x22MediaTotalCount\x22:0,\x22KeywordlIst\x22:[],\x22TimeAgo\x22:\x22a year ago\x22},{\x22Id\x22:\x22235339819\x22,\x22CID\x22:\x2299ec049a\u002D0ac3\u002D5b0b\u002D87e5\u002D30532d204445\x22,\x22SourceClient\x22:\x22samsung\u002Dtr_tr\x22,\x22LastModeratedTime\x22:\x222025\u002D06\u002D29T16:45:15.000+00:00\x22,\x22LastModificationTime\x22:\x222026\u002D04\u002D22T06:09:33.000+00:00\x22,\x22ProductId\x22:\x22SM\u002DL705FZTATUR\x22,\x22OriginalProductName\x22:\x22Galaxy Watch Ultra (LTE, 47mm)(SM\u002DL705FZTATUR)\x22,\x22CampaignId\x22:\x22BV_MOBILE_REVIEW_DISPLAY\x22,\x22ClientResponses\x22:[{\x22Department\x22:\x22Samsung Electronics\x22,\x22Response\x22:\x22Değerli Müşterimiz,\\n\\nD